INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('k1-c/linear-tui/m04-zero-cost', 'm04-zero-cost', 'k1-c', 'linear-tui', 'community', 'm04-zero-cost k1-c linear-tui community m04-zero-cost is a TUI client for Linear.app, enabling developers to manage issues, projects, and cycles from their terminal. It provides a zero-cost abstraction layer for efficient development. m04-zero-cost是一款用于Linear.app的TUI客户端，允许用户从终端管理问题、项目和周期 m04-zero-costはLinear.app用のTUIクライアントであり、ユーザーがターミナルから問題、プロジェクト、サイクルを管理できるようにします m04-zero-cost는 Linear.app용 TUI 클라이언트로 사용자가 터미널에서 문제, 프로젝트, 사이클을 관리할 수 있습니다 m04-zero-cost es un cliente TUI para Linear.app que permite gestionar problemas, proyectos y ciclos desde la terminal. Ofrece abstracción de costo cero y polimorfismo en tiempo de compilación o ejecución m04-zero-cost est un client TUI pour Linear.app qui permet de gérer les problèmes, les projets et les cycles depuis le terminal. Il offre une abstraction à coût nul et un polymorphisme en temps de compilation ou d''exécution m04-zero-cost ist ein TUI-Client für Linear.app, der die Verwaltung von Problemen, Projekten und Zyklen im Terminal ermöglicht. Er bietet eine Zero-Cost-Abstraktion und Polymorphismus zur Compile- oder Laufzeit O m04-zero-cost é um cliente TUI para Linear.app que permite gerenciar problemas, projetos e ciclos de forma eficiente m04-zero-cost - это клиент TUI для Linear.app, который позволяет управлять задачами, проектами и циклами эффективно m04-zero-cost هو عميل واجهة المستخدم النصية للinear.app الذي يسمح بإدارة المشكلات والمشاريع والدورات بفعالية how to use m04-zero-cost m04-zero-cost alternative m04-zero-cost setup guide what is m04-zero-cost m04-zero-cost vs Linear.app m04-zero-cost install zero-cost abstraction in m04-zero-cost m04-zero-cost for issue management m04-zero-cost and Linear.app integration m04-zero-cost Linear.app TUI客户端 终端管理 问题管理 项目管理 周期管理 编译时多态性 运行时多态性 Manages issues, projects, and cycles from the terminal using Linear.app Utilizes zero-cost abstraction for efficient development Handles compile-time and runtime polymorphism for optimal performance Provides solutions for error codes E0277 and E0308 with trait bounds and design questions Optimizes performance priority with heterogeneous collections and generics m04-zero-cost is a terminal-based user interface client for Linear.app, designed to streamline issue and project management with a focus on zero-cost abstraction.');
