erstützung für Python 3.10+","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung mit uv","Code-Analyse mit ruff","Einheitliche Tests mit pytest","Implementierung minimaler Änderungen","Überprüfung der Änderungen"],"pt":["Utiliza Python 3.10+ como linguagem de programação","Emprega uv para gerenciamento de dependências e execução","Utiliza ruff para lint e formatação de código","Emprega pytest para testes unitários","Fornece uma abordagem consistente para entrega de projetos","Suporta desenvolvimento de backend e frontend"],"ru":["Использует Python 3.10+ в качестве языка программирования","Использует uv для управления зависимостями и выполнения","Использует ruff для lint и форматирования кода","Использует pytest для юнит-тестов","Обеспечивает последовательный подход для доставки проектов и ИИ Агентов","Поддерживает разработку backend и frontend"],"ar":["يستخدم بايثون 3.10+ ك语言 برمجة","يستخدم uv لإدارة зависимости وتنفيذ","يستخدم ruff لتنسيق وتنسيق код","يستخدم pytest للاختبارات الوحدوية","يقدم نهجًا متسقًا لتقديم المشاريع","يدعم تطوير backend وfrontend"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use project-development-playbook","project-development-playbook setup guide","python 3.10+ template","uv dependencies","ruff lint format","pytest testing","project-development-playbook alternative","project-development-playbook vs vibe-coding"],"zh":["项目开发游戏规则","Python模板","一致的交付工作流","项目开发效率","Python 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","AIエージェント"],"ja":["プロジェクト開発プレイブック","Pythonテンプレート","一貫したデリバリーフロー","プロジェクト開発効率","Python 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","AIエージェント"],"ko":["프로젝트 개발 플레이북","Python 템플릿","일관된 전달 워크플로","프로젝트 개발 효율","Python 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","AI 툴"],"es":["project-development-playbook","plantilla python","flujo de trabajo","automatización de flujo de trabajo","python 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","desarrollo de proyectos"],"fr":["project-development-playbook","modèle python","flux de travail","automatisation de flux de travail","python 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","développement de projets"],"de":["project-development-playbook","python-vorlage","arbeitsablauf","workflow-automatisierung","python 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","projektentwicklung"],"pt":["Project Development Playbook","Python 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","desenvolvimento de projetos","entrega de projetos","abordagem consistente","backend","frontend"],"ru":["Project Development Playbook","Python 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","доставка проектов","разработка проектов","последовательный подход","ИИ Агенты","backend","frontend"],"ar":["كتاب إرشادات المشروع","بايثون 3.10+","uv","ruff","pytest","تقديم مشاريع","تطوير مشاريع","نهج متسق","ادوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","backend","frontend"]}},"owner":"Tendo33","repo":"python-template","repoPath":"Tendo33/python-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T02:59:42Z","topics":["python3","templates","vibe-coding"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-development-playbook","description":"Use when implementing project tasks that need consistent coding standards, verification, and frontend stack defaults.","bodyPreview":"# Project Development Playbook\n\n## Goal\n\nApply one consistent delivery workflow across backend and frontend tasks.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm scope and assumptions.\n2. Choose implementation path (backend, frontend, full stack).\n3. Implement minimal changes aligned with project conventions.\n4. Run relevant verification commands.\n5. Report what changed and what was verified.\n\n## Backend Defaults\n\n- Python 3.10+\n- `uv` for dependencies and execution\n- `ruff` for lint/format\n- `pytest` for tests\n\nFor","body":"# Project Development Playbook\n\n## Goal\n\nApply one consistent delivery workflow across backend and frontend tasks.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm scope and assumptions.\n2. Choose implementation path (backend, frontend, full stack).\n3. Implement minimal changes aligned with project conventions.\n4. Run relevant verification commands.\n5. Report what changed and what was verified.\n\n## Backend Defaults\n\n- Python 3.10+\n- `uv` for dependencies and execution\n- `ruff` for lint/format\n- `pytest` for tests\n\nFor deeper backend architecture rules, use `backend-engineering-playbook`.\n\n## Frontend Defaults\n\nUnless user specifies otherwise, use React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind.\n\nFor UI/UX work, start with:\n\n```bash\npython3 .codex/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system -p \"<project-name>\"\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nRun what applies:\n\n```bash\nuv run ruff check .\nuv run ruff format --check .\nuv run pytest\nnpm --prefix frontend run lint\nnpm --prefix frontend run typecheck\nnpm --prefix frontend run test\nnpm --prefix frontend run build\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:49:45.866Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing standardized project management workflows with Python 3.10+","zh":"适用于需要标准化项目管理工作流的开发代理，支持Python 3.10+","ja":"Python 3.10+を使用する開発エージェント向けに標準化されたプロジェクト管理ワークフローを提供","ko":"Python 3.10+를 사용하는 개발 에이전트에게 표준화된 프로젝트 관리 워크플로를 제공","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan flujos de trabajo de gestión de proyectos estandarizados con Python 3.10+","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de flux de travail de gestion de projet standardisés avec Python 3.10+","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die standardisierte Projektmanagement-Workflows mit Python 3.10+ benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de projetos padronizados com Python 3.10+","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуются стандартизированные рабочие процессы управления проектами с Python 3.10+","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى سير عمل إدارة مشروع معيارية مع Python 3.10+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline project development with consistent delivery workflows across backend and frontend tasks, utilizing libraries like uv for dependencies, ruff for lint/format, and pytest for tests","zh":"赋予代理简化项目开发的能力，利用uv、ruff和pytest等库，在后端和前端任务中实现一致的交付工作流","ja":"エージェントにプロジェクト開発を効率化する能力を与え、uv、ruff、pytestなどのライブラリを使用して、バックエンドとフロントエンドのタスクで一貫したデリバリーワークフローを実現","ko":"에이전트에게 프로젝트 개발을 간소화하는 능력을 부여하여 uv, ruff, pytest 등의 라이브러리를 사용하여 백엔드와 프론트엔드 태스크에서 일관된 배포 워크플로를 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar el desarrollo de proyectos con flujos de trabajo de entrega coherentes en tareas de backend y frontend, utilizando bibliotecas como uv para dependencias, ruff para lint/format y pytest para pruebas","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser le développement de projets avec des flux de travail de livraison cohérents pour les tâches backend et frontend, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme uv pour les dépendances, ruff pour lint/format et pytest pour les tests","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Projektentwicklung mit konsistenten Lieferworkflows über Backend- und Frontend-Aufgaben zu rationalisieren, indem Bibliotheken wie uv für Abhängigkeiten, ruff für lint/format und pytest für Tests verwendet werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem o desenvolvimento do projeto com fluxos de entrega consistentes em tarefas de backend e frontend, utilizando bibliotecas como uv para dependências, ruff para lint/format e pytest para testes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать разработку проекта thanks to последовательными рабочими процессами доставки задач backend и frontend, используя библиотеки seperti uv для зависимостей, ruff для lint/формат и pytest для тестов","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تسريع تطوير المشروع مع سير عمل تسليم متسق عبر مهام الخلفية والواجهة الأمامية، باستخدام مكتبات مثل uv للاتكال، ruff لتنسيق lint و pytest للاختبارات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating verification commands for backend and frontend changes","Generating reports on implemented changes and verification results","Implementing minimal code changes aligned with project conventions"],"zh":["自动化后端和前端更改的验证命令","生成已实现更改和验证结果的报告","实施与项目约定一致的最小代码更改"],"ja":["バックエンドとフロントエンドの変更の検証コマンドを自動化","実装された変更と検証結果のレポートを生成","プロジェクトの規約に従った最小限のコード変更を実装"],"ko":["백엔드와 프론트엔드 변경의 검증 명령 자동화","구현된 변경과 검증 결과의 보고서 생성","프로젝트 규약을 준수한 최소한의 코드 변경 구현"],"es":["Automatizar comandos de verificación para cambios de backend y frontend","Generar informes sobre los cambios implementados y los resultados de la verificación","Implementar cambios de código mínimos alineados con las convenciones del proyecto"],"fr":["Automatiser les commandes de vérification pour les modifications de backend et de frontend","Générer des rapports sur les modifications mises en œuvre et les résultats de la vérification","Mettre en œuvre des modifications de code minimales alignées sur les conventions du projet"],"de":["Automatisieren von Überprüfungsbefehlen für Änderungen an Backend und Frontend","Erstellen von Berichten über die implementierten Änderungen und die Überprüfungsergebnisse","Implementieren minimaler Codeänderungen, die mit den Projektkonventionen übereinstimmen"],"pt":["Automatizar comandos de verificação para alterações de backend e frontend","Gerar relatórios sobre alterações implementadas e resultados de verificação","Implementar alterações de código mínimas alinhadas com convenções de projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать команды проверки для изменений backend и frontend","Генерировать отчеты об реализованных изменениях и результатах проверки","Реализовывать минимальные изменения кода, выровненные с конвенциями проекта"],"ar":["تحسين أوامر التحقق لتغييرات الخلفية والأمامية","توليد تقارير عن التغييرات المطبقة ونواتج التحقق","تنفيذ تغييرات برمجية قليلة تتوافق مع اتفاقيات المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.10+","Limited to backend and frontend tasks","Dependent on uv, ruff, and pytest libraries"],"zh":["需要Python 3.10+","仅限于后端和前端任务","依赖于uv、ruff和pytest库"],"ja":["Python 3.10+が必要","バックエンドとフロントエンドのタスクのみ","uv、ruff、pytestライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Python 3.10+ 필요","백엔드와 프론트엔드 태스크만 해당","uv, ruff, pytest 라이브러리 의존"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.10+","Limitado a tareas de backend y frontend","Dependiente de las bibliotecas uv, ruff y pytest"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.10+","Limité aux tâches de backend et de frontend","Dépendant des bibliothèques uv, ruff et pytest"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.10+","Begrenzt auf Backend- und Frontend-Aufgaben","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken uv, ruff und pytest"],"pt":["Requer Python 3.10+","Limitado a tarefas de backend e frontend","Dependente das bibliotecas uv, ruff e pytest"],"ru":["Требуется Python 3.10+","Ограничен задачами backend и frontend","Зависит от библиотек uv, ruff и pytest"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3.10+","محدود بمهام الخلفية والأمامية","يعتمد على المكتبات uv و ruff و pytest"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f752fb26ac2be27795ef158d43472dd25e7fadd330d95218ee77b4abb22b7223","qualityScore":33}');
