 la catalogación","fr":"L''Auction Catalog est un assistant de catalogage d''enchères qui utilise l''IA pour améliorer la précision du catalogage","de":"Auction Catalog ist ein Auktionen-Katalogisierungs-Assistent, der KI verwendet, um die Genauigkeit der Katalogisierung zu verbessern","pt":"O que é Assistente de Catalogação de Leilão? É uma ferramenta que ajuda a aplicar convenções de catalogação corretas","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент для каталогизации аукциона? Это инструмент, который помогает применять правильные конвенции каталогизации","ar":"ما هو مساعد فهرسة المزاد؟ هو أداة تساعد في تطبيق اتفاقيات فهرسة صحيحة"},"features":{"en":["Applies title formatting rules for categories like Furniture (Möbler)","Excludes wood type from titles and includes style, period, and designer information","Supports argument-based focus on specific categories or topics using $ARGUMENTS","Provides cataloging conventions for modifying quality rules and AI prompts","Enhances validation logic in the Auctionet AI Cataloging Assistant Chrome Extension"],"zh":["标题格式规则","分类说明","支持Furniture（Möbler）类别","支持AI Cataloging Assistant Chrome扩展","提供设计师和时期信息","支持自定义分类"],"ja":["タイトル形式のルール","カテゴリの説明","Furniture（Möbler）カテゴリのサポート","AIエージェントカタログアシスタントChrome拡張のサポート","デザイナーと時期の情報を提供","カスタムカテゴリのサポート"],"ko":["제목 형식 규칙","분류 설명","가구（Möbler）분류 지원","AI 카탈로그 조력자 Chrome 확장 지원","디자이너 및 시기 정보 제공","사용자 정의 분류 지원"],"es":["Aplicación de convenciones de catalogación para muebles","Inclusión del estilo, período y diseñador en los títulos","Exclusión del tipo de madera en los títulos","Uso de argumentos para enfocarse en categorías específicas","Compatibilidad con la extensión de Chrome"],"fr":["Application des conventions de catalogage pour les meubles","Inclusion du style, de la période et du designer dans les titres","Exclusion du type de bois dans les titres","Utilisation d''arguments pour se concentrer sur des catégories spécifiques","Compatibilité avec l''extension Chrome"],"de":["Anwendung von Katalogisierungskonventionen für Möbel","Einbeziehung von Stil, Periode und Designer in die Titel","Ausschluss von Holztypen in den Titeln","Verwendung von Argumenten, um sich auf bestimmte Kategorien zu konzentrieren","Kompatibilität mit der Chrome-Erweiterung"],"pt":["Suporte a regras de formatação de títulos por categoria","Inclusão de estilo, período e designer nos títulos","Exclusão do tipo de madeira dos títulos","Suporte a descrições detalhadas dos itens"],"ru":["Поддержка правил форматирования заголовков по категориям","Включение стиля, периода и дизайнера в заголовки","Исключение типа дерева из заголовков","Поддержка подробных описаний лотов"],"ar":["دعم قواعد تنسيق العناوين حسب الفئة","إدراج الأسلوب والفترة والمصمم في العناوين","استبعاد نوع الخشب من العناوين","دعم وصف مفصل للعناصر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use auction-catalog","auction-catalog setup guide","auction-catalog alternative","auction-catalog vs cataloging tools","auction-catalog install","what is auction-catalog","auction-catalog for developers","auction-catalog chrome extension","auction cataloging best practices"],"zh":["Auction Catalog","AI Cataloging Assistant","Chrome扩展","标题格式规则","分类说明","Furniture","Möbler","AIエージェント","cataloging"],"ja":["オークションカタログ","AIエージェントカタログアシスタント","Chrome拡張","タイトル形式のルール","カテゴリの説明","Furniture","Möbler","AIツール","cataloging"],"ko":["경매 카탈로그","AI 카탈로그 조력자","Chrome 확장","제목 형식 규칙","분류 설명","가구","Möbler","AI 에이전트","cataloging"],"es":["agentes de AI para subastas","catalogación de subastas","convenciones de catalogación","extensión de Chrome para subastas","herramientas de AI para subastas","mejora de la catalogación","subastas en línea","tecnologías de AI para subastas"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les enchères","catalogage d''enchères","conventions de catalogage","extension Chrome pour les enchères","outils d''IA pour les enchères","amélioration du catalogage","enchères en ligne","technologies d''IA pour les enchères"],"de":["KI-Tools für Auktionen","Katalogisierung von Auktionen","Katalogisierungskonventionen","Chrome-Erweiterung für Auktionen","KI-Tools für Auktionen","Verbesserung der Katalogisierung","Online-Auktionen","KI-Technologien für Auktionen"],"pt":["assistente de catalogação de leilão","ferramentas de catalogação","regras de formatação de títulos","catalogação de móveis","extensão do chrome para leilões","otimização de leilões","ferramentas de ai para leilões"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для каталогизации аукциона","инструменты каталогизации","правила форматирования заголовков","каталогизация мебели","расширение Chrome для аукционов","оптимизация аукционов","инструменты ИИ для аукционов"],"ar":["مساعد فهرسة المزاد","أدوات فهرسة","قواعد تنسيق العناوين","فهرسة الأثاث","ملحق الكروم للمزاد","تحسين المزاد","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمزاد"]}},"owner":"MixxMasterMike123","repo":"auctionet-extension","repoPath":"MixxMasterMike123/auctionet-extension","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T11:05:37Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"auction-catalog","description":"Reference guide for Swedish auction cataloging conventions and Auctionet FAQ compliance. Use when working on title formatting, description rules, condition reports, or quality validation logic.","bodyPreview":"# Auction Cataloging Reference\n\nUse this skill to look up or apply correct cataloging conventions when modifying quality rules, AI prompts, or validation logic in the extension.\n\nIf an argument is provided, focus on that category or topic: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\n## Title Formatting Rules (by category)\n\n### Furniture (Möbler)\n```\nBYRÅ, gustaviansk, sent 1700-tal.\nFÅTÖLJ, \"Karin\", Bruno Mathsson, Dux.\n```\n- NEVER include wood type in title (put in description)\n- Include: style, period, designer if known\n-","body":"# Auction Cataloging Reference\n\nUse this skill to look up or apply correct cataloging conventions when modifying quality rules, AI prompts, or validation logic in the extension.\n\nIf an argument is provided, focus on that category or topic: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\n## Title Formatting Rules (by category)\n\n### Furniture (Möbler)\n```\nBYRÅ, gustaviansk, sent 1700-tal.\nFÅTÖLJ, \"Karin\", Bruno Mathsson, Dux.\n```\n- NEVER include wood type in title (put in description)\n- Include: style, period, designer if known\n- Signed furniture: include maker in title\n\n### Small Items (Småsaker)\n```\nVAS, majolika, nyrenässans, Gustafsberg, sent 1800-tal.\nSKÅL, glas, Bertil Vallien, Kosta Boda, sign.\n```\n- NEVER combine material+object (\"MAJOLIKAVAS\" is WRONG → \"VAS, majolika\")\n- NEVER \"KERAMIKTOMTE\" → \"TOMTE, keramik\"\n\n### Services (Serviser)\n```\nMATSERVIS, 89 delar, porslin, \"Maria Björnbär\", Rosenthal.\nMAT- OCH KAFFESERVIS, 38 delar, flintgods, rokokostil, Rörstrand, tidigt 1900-tal.\n```\n- Always: type, piece count, material, pattern name, manufacturer, period\n\n### Rugs (Mattor)\n```\nMATTA, orientalisk, semiantik, ca 320 x 230 cm.\n```\n- Dimensions ALWAYS in title (exception to normal rule)\n- Priority category at intake — catalog fully at intake\n\n### Silver\n```\nBÄGARE, 2 st, silver, rokokostil, CG Hallberg, Stockholm, 1942-56, ca 450 gram.\n```\n- Always research hallmarks\n- Weight always LAST in title\n- No weight for filled-base items (candelabras with weighted base)\n\n### Art (Konst)\n```\nBENGT LINDSTRÖM, färglitografier, 2 st, signerade och daterade 76 och numrerade 120/310.\nBRUNO LILJEFORS, \"Enkelbeckasin i höstskog\", olja på duk, signerad B.L och daterad -28.\n```\n- Artist name in artist field (auto-prepended in UPPERCASE)\n- Quoted titles ONLY for artist-given titles\n- Write signatures/dates exactly as on the work: distinguish \"1832\" vs \"-32\" vs \"32\"\n- \"sign. a tergo\" for reverse signatures\n- Piece count after technique, not after artist\n- \"Ej sign.\" in description for unsigned works\n\n### Unidentified Artist\n```\nOIDENTIFIERAD KONSTNÄR, Rådjur, skulptur, brons, otydligt signerad, 18/1900-tal.\n```\n- Use when signature is clear but artist cannot be identified\n- Always take a detail photo of the signature\n- Droit de suite still applies\n\n## Description Rules\n\n### General\n- Be thorough — especially things hard to see in photos\n- Write out full words, no abbreviations (for Google SEO)\n- Always include: creator, material, manufacturer, measurements, weight (where applicable)\n- Provenance, exhibitions, literature: write before measurements\n\n### Measurements\n- Format: `Höjd 84, bredd 47 cm` or `Längd 84, bredd 47, höjd 92 cm`\n- Art: `45 x 78 cm` (height × width, without frame)\n- Always last in description (except rugs/ceiling lamps → in title)\n- Use \"ca\" for approximate measurements\n- Graphics: clarify \"bladstorlek\" vs \"bildstorlek\"\n- Rings: only ring size, no measurements\n\n### Services Description\n- No measurements needed\n- List all pieces: `34 mattallrikar, 25 djupa tallrikar, såsskål samt tillbringare`\n- Single items NOT preceded by \"1\" — just name them\n- No \"st\" after single items\n\n## Condition Report Rules\n\n### Dos\n- Be thorough when possible, vague when necessary\n- Always use \"Ej examinerad ur ram\" for framed art\n- Always mention engravings/monograms on silver\n- Use \"Ej genomgånget\" for books and similar\n- Always photograph visible damage\n\n### Don''ts\n- NEVER use \"bruksslitage\" as standalone condition — specify damage type\n- NEVER use \"Ej funktionstestad\" — implies we test items\n- AVOID \"Ingen anmärkning\" — leads to complaints\n- NEVER comment on frame condition (unless the frame IS the item)\n- Avoid abbreviations: mm, bl a, osv\n- Paintings don''t have \"bruksslitage\" — they''re not \"used\"\n\n### Preferred Specific Terms\n| Instead of \"Bruksslitage\" | Use |\n|---------------------------|-----|\n| Furniture | Smärre ytslitage, repor, märken, fläckar, ringmärken |\n| Glass/Ceramics | Smärre nagg, ytslitage, hårspricka |\n| Textiles/Rugs | Slitage fransar, fläckar, färgförändringar |\n| Paintings | Sedvanligt slitage, ramslitage, krakelyrer |\n| Silver | Bucklor, repor, lagningar, monogram |\n\n## Forbidden Language\nNever use subjective/selling language:\n`fin, vacker, värdefull, stor, elegant, karakteristisk, typisk, klassisk, traditionell, autentisk, raffinerad, stilren, harmonisk, genomarbetad, påkostad, exklusiv, förnäm, gedigen, kvalitativ, förstklassig, exemplarisk, representativ`\n\n## Photography Guidelines\n- Minimum 3 photos per item\n- Always: front, back, important details\n- Specific: stamps, signatures, damages, maker marks\n- Silver/gold: always show hallmarks\n- Art: signature detail + back of frame for older works\n- Rugs: full view + corner + back\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:54:11.904Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Cataloging Agents needing standardized title formatting rules for auction items.","zh":"适用于需要标准化标题格式规则的AI目录代理，为拍卖项目提供规范化的标题格式。","ja":"オークションアイテムの標準化されたタイトルフォーマット規則を必要とするAIカタログエージェントに最適です。","ko":"경매 항목을 위한 표준화된 제목 형식 규칙이 필요한 AI 카탈로그 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de catalogación de IA que necesitan reglas de formato de título estandarizadas para artículos de subasta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de catalogage IA ayant besoin de règles de formatage de titre standardisées pour les articles de vente aux enchères.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Katalogisierungsagenten, die standardisierte Titelformatierungsregeln für Auktionsartikel benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Catalogação de IA que necessitam de regras de formatação de títulos padronizadas para itens de leilão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов каталогизации ИИ, которым требуются стандартизированные правила форматирования заголовков для аукционных лотов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكيل الفهرسة الإلكترونية الذي يحتاج إلى قواعد تنسيق العناوين المعيارية للعناصر المزاد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply correct cataloging conventions for quality rules, AI prompts, and validation logic, including style, period, and designer information, while excluding wood type from titles and utilizing protocols like the Auctionet AI Cataloging Assistant Chrome Extension.","zh":"赋予代理应用正确的目录约定，用于质量规则、AI提示和验证逻辑，包括样式、时期和设计师信息，同时排除木材类型从标题并利用协议如Auctionet AI目录辅助Chrome扩展。","ja":"エージェントに、スタイル、時代、デザイナー情報を含む、質の規則、AIプロンプト、検証ロジックに対する正しいカタログ化規約を適用する力を与え、木材の種類をタイトルから除外し、Auctionet AIカタログ化アシスタントChrome拡張機能などのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 품질 규칙, AI 프롬프트 및 검증 논리에 대한 올바른 카탈로그 규칙을 적용할 수 있도록 하며, 스타일, 시대, 디자이너 정보를 포함하고, 제목에서 나무 유형을 제외하고, Auctionet AI 카탈로그화 보조 Chrome 확장 프로그램과 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar convenciones de catalogación correctas para reglas de calidad, prompts de IA y lógica de validación, incluyendo estilo, período y información del diseñador, al mismo tiempo que se excluye el tipo de madera de los títulos y se utilizan protocolos como la extensión de Chrome de asistente de catalogación de Auctionet AI.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des conventions de catalogage correctes pour les règles de qualité, les invites de l''IA et la logique de validation, y compris le style, la période et les informations du designer, tout en excluant le type de bois des titres et en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''extension Chrome de l''assistant de catalogage Auctionet AI.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, korrekte Katalogisierungskonventionen für Qualitätsregeln, AI-Prompts und Validierungslogik anzuwenden, einschließlich Stil, Periode und Designerinformationen, während Holztypen von Titeln ausgeschlossen werden und Protokolle wie die Auctionet AI-Katalogisierungs-Assistenten-Chrome-Erweiterung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar convenções de catalogação corretas para regras de qualidade, prompts de IA e lógica de validação, incluindo estilo, período e informações do designer, ao mesmo tempo em que exclui o tipo de madeira dos títulos e utiliza protocolos como o Auctionet AI Cataloging Assistant Chrome Extension.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять правильные конвенции каталогизации для правил качества, запросов ИИ и логики проверки, включая стиль, период и информацию о дизайнере, при этом исключая тип дерева из названий и используя протоколы, такие как расширение Auctionet AI Cataloging Assistant для Chrome.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق اتفاقيات التسجيل الصحيحة لقواعد الجودة وطروحات الذكاء الاصطناعي ومنطق التحقق، بما في ذلك الأسلوب والفترة ومعلومات المصمم، في نفس الوقت الذي يستثني فيه نوع الخشب من العناوين ويتوافق مع بروتوكولات مثل ملحق مساعد فهرسة Auctionet AI لجوجل كروم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating title formatting for furniture items","Generating validation logic for auction catalog entries","Applying quality rules for auction item descriptions"],"zh":["家具项目的标题格式自动化","生成拍卖目录条目的验证逻辑","应用拍卖项目描述的质量规则"],"ja":["家具アイテムのタイトルフォーマットの自動化","オークションカタログエントリの検証ロジックの生成","オークションアイテムの説明の品質規則の適用"],"ko":["가구 항목의 제목 형식 자동화","경매 카탈로그 항목의 검증 논리 생성","경매 항목 설명의 품질 규칙 적용"],"es":["Automatización del formato de título para artículos de muebles","Generación de lógica de validación para entradas de catálogo de subasta","Aplicación de reglas de calidad para descripciones de artículos de subasta"],"fr":["Automatisation du formatage de titre pour les articles de meubles","Génération de la logique de validation pour les entrées de catalogue de vente aux enchères","Application des règles de qualité pour les descriptions d''articles de vente aux enchères"],"de":["Automatisierung des Titelformats für Möbelartikel","Generierung von Validierungslogik für Auktionskatalogeinträge","Anwendung von Qualitätsregeln für Auktionsartikelbeschreibungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a formatação de títulos para itens de mobiliário","Gerar lógica de validação para entradas de catálogo de leilão","Aplicar regras de qualidade para descrições de itens de leilão"],"ru":["Автоматизировать форматирование заголовков для предметов мебели","Генерировать логику проверки для записей аукционного каталога","Применять правила качества для описаний аукционных лотов"],"ar":["توفير تنسيق تلقائي للعناوين لعناصر الأثاث","توليد 논리 التحقق لمدخلات فهرس المزاد","تطبيق قواعد الجودة لوصف عناصر المزاد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of auction cataloging conventions","Limited to specific categories like furniture (Möbler)"],"zh":["需要了解拍卖目录约定","仅限于特定类别，如家具（Möbler）"],"ja":["オークションカタログ規約の知識が必要","家具（Möbler）などの特定のカテゴリのみに限定"],"ko":["경매 카탈로그 규약에 대한 지식이 필요","가구(Möbler)와 같은 특정 범주에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de convenciones de catalogación de subasta","Limitado a categorías específicas como muebles (Möbler)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en conventions de catalogage de vente aux enchères","Limité à des catégories spécifiques comme les meubles (Möbler)"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über Auktionskatalogisierungskonventionen","Begrenzt auf spezifische Kategorien wie Möbel (Möbler)"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das convenções de catalogação de leilão","Limitado a categorias específicas, como mobiliário (Möbler)"],"ru":["Требует знания конвенций аукционной каталогизации","Ограничен конкретными категориями, такими как мебель (Möbler)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة الاتفاقيات المتبعة في فهرسة المزاد","محدود بالفئات المحددة، مثل الأثاث (Möbler)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"2e66669db0ff205d4a7194071751d744786027ebcee163a4fc2357ce689728b3","qualityScore":33}');
