pt":"O Create-Theme é um conjunto de ferramentas para criar temas personalizados para Stitches RSC","ru":"Create-Theme - это набор инструментов для создания тем для Stitches RSC","ar":"Create-Theme هو مجموعة أدوات لإنشاء Темات مخصصة ل Stitches RSC"},"features":{"en":["Generates theme configurations using the createStitches function from @stitches-rsc/react","Supports design tokens organized by scale, including colors, space, fontSizes, and fonts","Creates properly structured and typed theme configurations for Stitches RSC","Enables the configuration of design tokens using TypeScript","Integrates with React Server Components for efficient theming"],"zh":["使用 Stitches RSC 创建主题配置","支持设计令牌、颜色、间距和字体大小等","零运行时的 Stitches.js 替代品","适用于 React 服务器组件","类型安全的主题配置"],"ja":["Stitches RSC を使用してテーマ構成を作成","デザイン トークン、色、スペース、フォント サイズなどをサポート","Zero-runtime の Stitches.js 代替","React サーバーコンポーネントに適している","型安全のテーマ構成"],"ko":["Stitches RSC를 사용하여 테마 구성 만들기","디자인 토큰, 색상, 간격 및 글꼴 크기 지원","Zero-runtime의 Stitches.js 대체","React 서버 컴포넌트에 적합","타입 안전 테마 구성"],"es":["Compatibilidad con React Server Components","Creación de temas personalizados con tokens de diseño","Organización de tokens por escala","Soporte para colores, espaciado y tipografía","Integración con Stitches RSC","Tipado y estructura de temas"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec React Server Components","Création de thèmes personnalisés avec des jetons de conception","Organisation des jetons par échelle","Prise en charge des couleurs, de l''espacement et de la typographie","Intégration avec Stitches RSC","Typage et structure de thèmes"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit React Server Components","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Themes mit Design-Tokens","Organisation von Tokens nach Skala","Unterstützung für Farben, Abstände und Typografie","Integration mit Stitches RSC","Typisierung und Struktur von Themes"],"pt":["Criação de temas personalizados para Stitches RSC","Inclusão de design tokens e escalas","Suporte a React Server Components","Configuração de cores, espaçamento e fontes","Criação de temas tipados e estruturados"],"ru":["Создание тем для Stitches RSC","Включение токенов дизайна и масштабов","Поддержка React Server Components","Настройка цветов,间距 и шрифтов","Создание тем с типами и структурами"],"ar":["إنشاء Темات مخصصة ل Stitches RSC","إضافة رموز التصميم والاسكاليات","دعم مكونات الخادم React","تكوين الألوان والفضاء والخطوط","إنشاء Темات مع أنواع وهياكل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use create-theme","create-theme alternative","create-theme vs Stitches.js","create-theme install","create-theme setup guide","what is create-theme","create-theme for React Server Components","Stitches RSC theme configuration","zero-runtime theming for React"],"zh":["Stitches RSC","创建主题","零运行时","React 服务器组件","设计令牌","颜色","间距","字体大小","AIエージェント","前端开发"],"ja":["Stitches RSC","テーマ作成","Zero-runtime","React サーバーコンポーネント","デザイン トークン","色","スペース","フォント サイズ","AIエージェント","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Stitches RSC","테마 생성","Zero-runtime","React 서버 컴포넌트","디자인 토큰","색상","간격","글꼴 크기","AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["create-theme","Stitches RSC","React Server Components","temas personalizados","tokens de diseño","configuración de temas","GUI de create-theme","Herramientas de creación de temas","Desarrollo de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["create-theme","Stitches RSC","React Server Components","thèmes personnalisés","jetons de conception","configuration de thèmes","GUI de create-theme","Outils de création de thèmes","Développement d''applications web"],"de":["create-theme","Stitches RSC","React Server Components","benutzerdefinierte Themes","Design-Tokens","Themenkonfiguration","GUI von create-theme","Tools zur Erstellung von Themes","Webanwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Create-Theme","Stitches RSC","React Server Components","design tokens","escalas de design","temas personalizados","configuração de tema","criação de tema"],"ru":["Create-Theme","Stitches RSC","React Server Components","токены дизайна","масштабы дизайна","пользовательские темы","настройка темы","создание темы"],"ar":["Create-Theme","Stitches RSC","React Server Components","رموز التصميم","الاسكاليات التصميمية","التمات المخصصة","تكوين التема","إنشاء التема"]}},"owner":"artmsilva","repo":"stitches-rsc","repoPath":"artmsilva/stitches-rsc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-01-28T00:26:57Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-theme","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create a theme, set up theme tokens, configure design tokens, add colors/spacing/typography, build a theme config, or wants help structuring a Stitches RSC theme configuration.","bodyPreview":"# Create Stitches RSC Theme\n\nGuide creation of properly structured and typed theme configurations for Stitches RSC.\n\n## Theme Structure Overview\n\nA Stitches theme consists of design tokens organized by scale:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createStitches } from ''@stitches-rsc/react'';\n\nconst { styled, css, theme, createTheme } = createStitches({\n  theme: {\n    colors: { /* color tokens */ },\n    space: { /* spacing tokens */ },\n    fontSizes: { /* typography scale */ },\n    fonts: { /* font families */","body":"# Create Stitches RSC Theme\n\nGuide creation of properly structured and typed theme configurations for Stitches RSC.\n\n## Theme Structure Overview\n\nA Stitches theme consists of design tokens organized by scale:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createStitches } from ''@stitches-rsc/react'';\n\nconst { styled, css, theme, createTheme } = createStitches({\n  theme: {\n    colors: { /* color tokens */ },\n    space: { /* spacing tokens */ },\n    fontSizes: { /* typography scale */ },\n    fonts: { /* font families */ },\n    fontWeights: { /* font weights */ },\n    lineHeights: { /* line heights */ },\n    letterSpacings: { /* letter spacing */ },\n    sizes: { /* width/height tokens */ },\n    borderWidths: { /* border widths */ },\n    borderStyles: { /* border styles */ },\n    radii: { /* border radius */ },\n    shadows: { /* box shadows */ },\n    zIndices: { /* z-index scale */ },\n    transitions: { /* transition values */ },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Creating a Theme Step-by-Step\n\n### Step 1: Define Color Palette\n\nStart with semantic color tokens:\n\n```typescript\nconst theme = {\n  colors: {\n    // Brand colors\n    primary: ''#0070f3'',\n    primaryLight: ''#3291ff'',\n    primaryDark: ''#0051a8'',\n\n    // Semantic colors\n    success: ''#0070f3'',\n    warning: ''#f5a623'',\n    error: ''#e00'',\n    info: ''#0070f3'',\n\n    // Neutrals\n    background: ''#ffffff'',\n    foreground: ''#000000'',\n    border: ''#eaeaea'',\n\n    // Text\n    text: ''#171717'',\n    textMuted: ''#666666'',\n    textInverse: ''#ffffff'',\n\n    // Interactive states\n    hover: ''rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)'',\n    active: ''rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)'',\n    focus: ''rgba(0, 112, 243, 0.4)'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Step 2: Define Spacing Scale\n\nUse a consistent spacing scale (4px base recommended):\n\n```typescript\nconst theme = {\n  space: {\n    0: ''0'',\n    1: ''4px'',\n    2: ''8px'',\n    3: ''12px'',\n    4: ''16px'',\n    5: ''20px'',\n    6: ''24px'',\n    7: ''28px'',\n    8: ''32px'',\n    9: ''36px'',\n    10: ''40px'',\n    12: ''48px'',\n    14: ''56px'',\n    16: ''64px'',\n    20: ''80px'',\n    24: ''96px'',\n    // Semantic aliases\n    xs: ''4px'',\n    sm: ''8px'',\n    md: ''16px'',\n    lg: ''24px'',\n    xl: ''32px'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Step 3: Define Typography\n\n```typescript\nconst theme = {\n  fonts: {\n    sans: ''Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif'',\n    serif: ''Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif'',\n    mono: ''Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace'',\n  },\n\n  fontSizes: {\n    xs: ''0.75rem'',    // 12px\n    sm: ''0.875rem'',   // 14px\n    base: ''1rem'',     // 16px\n    lg: ''1.125rem'',   // 18px\n    xl: ''1.25rem'',    // 20px\n    ''2xl'': ''1.5rem'',  // 24px\n    ''3xl'': ''1.875rem'',// 30px\n    ''4xl'': ''2.25rem'', // 36px\n    ''5xl'': ''3rem'',    // 48px\n  },\n\n  fontWeights: {\n    thin: ''100'',\n    light: ''300'',\n    normal: ''400'',\n    medium: ''500'',\n    semibold: ''600'',\n    bold: ''700'',\n    extrabold: ''800'',\n  },\n\n  lineHeights: {\n    none: ''1'',\n    tight: ''1.25'',\n    snug: ''1.375'',\n    normal: ''1.5'',\n    relaxed: ''1.625'',\n    loose: ''2'',\n  },\n\n  letterSpacings: {\n    tighter: ''-0.05em'',\n    tight: ''-0.025em'',\n    normal: ''0'',\n    wide: ''0.025em'',\n    wider: ''0.05em'',\n    widest: ''0.1em'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Step 4: Define Visual Properties\n\n```typescript\nconst theme = {\n  radii: {\n    none: ''0'',\n    sm: ''2px'',\n    base: ''4px'',\n    md: ''6px'',\n    lg: ''8px'',\n    xl: ''12px'',\n    ''2xl'': ''16px'',\n    full: ''9999px'',\n  },\n\n  shadows: {\n    none: ''none'',\n    sm: ''0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)'',\n    base: ''0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)'',\n    md: ''0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)'',\n    lg: ''0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)'',\n    xl: ''0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04)'',\n    inner: ''inset 0 2px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)'',\n  },\n\n  borderWidths: {\n    0: ''0'',\n    1: ''1px'',\n    2: ''2px'',\n    4: ''4px'',\n    8: ''8px'',\n  },\n\n  zIndices: {\n    hide: ''-1'',\n    auto: ''auto'',\n    base: ''0'',\n    docked: ''10'',\n    dropdown: ''1000'',\n    sticky: ''1100'',\n    banner: ''1200'',\n    overlay: ''1300'',\n    modal: ''1400'',\n    popover: ''1500'',\n    toast: ''1700'',\n    tooltip: ''1800'',\n  },\n\n  transitions: {\n    none: ''none'',\n    fast: ''150ms ease'',\n    base: ''200ms ease'',\n    slow: ''300ms ease'',\n    slower: ''400ms ease'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Using Theme Tokens\n\nReference tokens with `$scale$token` syntax:\n\n```typescript\nconst Button = styled(''button'', {\n  backgroundColor: ''$colors$primary'',\n  padding: ''$space$2 $space$4'',\n  fontSize: ''$fontSizes$base'',\n  fontFamily: ''$fonts$sans'',\n  borderRadius: ''$radii$md'',\n  boxShadow: ''$shadows$sm'',\n  transition: ''all $transitions$fast'',\n\n  ''&:hover'': {\n    backgroundColor: ''$colors$primaryDark'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\nShorthand for same-name scale (using themeMap):\n\n```typescript\nconst Button = styled(''button'', {\n  // These are equivalent due to defaultThemeMap\n  color: ''$primary'',           // maps to colors.primary\n  padding: ''$2'',               // maps to space.2\n  fontSize: ''$base'',           // maps to fontSizes.base\n});\n```\n\n## Creating Theme Variants\n\nCreate alternate themes with `createTheme`:\n\n```typescript\nconst darkTheme = createTheme(''dark'', {\n  colors: {\n    background: ''#0a0a0a'',\n    foreground: ''#ffffff'',\n    text: ''#ededed'',\n    textMuted: ''#a1a1a1'',\n    border: ''#333333'',\n    primary: ''#3291ff'',\n    hover: ''rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)'',\n  },\n});\n\n// Apply theme with className\n<div className={darkTheme}>\n  <App />\n</div>\n```\n\n## Complete Example\n\n```typescript\n// stitches.config.ts\nimport { createStitches } from ''@stitches-rsc/react'';\n\nexport const {\n  styled,\n  css,\n  globalCss,\n  keyframes,\n  theme,\n  createTheme,\n  getCssText,\n} = createStitches({\n  prefix: ''app'',\n\n  theme: {\n    colors: {\n      primary: ''#0070f3'',\n      primaryLight: ''#3291ff'',\n      primaryDark: ''#0051a8'',\n      secondary: ''#7928ca'',\n      success: ''#17c964'',\n      warning: ''#f5a623'',\n      error: ''#f21361'',\n      background: ''#ffffff'',\n      foreground: ''#000000'',\n      text: ''#171717'',\n      textMuted: ''#666666'',\n      border: ''#eaeaea'',\n    },\n    space: {\n      1: ''4px'', 2: ''8px'', 3: ''12px'', 4: ''16px'',\n      5: ''20px'', 6: ''24px'', 8: ''32px'', 10: ''40px'',\n    },\n    fontSizes: {\n      xs: ''0.75rem'', sm: ''0.875rem'', base: ''1rem'',\n      lg: ''1.125rem'', xl: ''1.25rem'', ''2xl'': ''1.5rem'',\n    },\n    fonts: {\n      sans: ''Inter, -apple-system, sans-serif'',\n      mono: ''Menlo, monospace'',\n    },\n    fontWeights: { normal: ''400'', medium: ''500'', bold: ''700'' },\n    lineHeights: { tight: ''1.25'', normal: ''1.5'', relaxed: ''1.75'' },\n    radii: { sm: ''4px'', md: ''8px'', lg: ''12px'', full: ''9999px'' },\n    shadows: {\n      sm: ''0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)'',\n      md: ''0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)'',\n    },\n    zIndices: { modal: ''1000'', tooltip: ''1500'' },\n    transitions: { fast: ''150ms ease'', base: ''200ms ease'' },\n  },\n\n  media: {\n    sm: ''(min-width: 640px)'',\n    md: ''(min-width: 768px)'',\n    lg: ''(min-width: 1024px)'',\n    xl: ''(min-width: 1280px)'',\n  },\n\n  utils: {\n    mx: (value: string) => ({ marginLeft: value, marginRight: value }),\n    my: (value: string) => ({ marginTop: value, marginBottom: value }),\n    px: (value: string) => ({ paddingLeft: value, paddingRight: value }),\n    py: (value: string) => ({ paddingTop: value, paddingBottom: value }),\n    size: (value: string) => ({ width: value, height: value }),\n  },\n});\n\nexport const darkTheme = createTheme(''dark'', {\n  colors: {\n    background: ''#0a0a0a'',\n    foreground: ''#ffffff'',\n    text: ''#ededed'',\n    textMuted: ''#a1a1a1'',\n    border: ''#333333'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nSee `references/theme-scales.md` for the complete list of theme scales and their CSS property mappings.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:09:12.669Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing structured theme configurations for Stitches RSC in React applications.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化主题配置的React应用程序中的Stitches RSC的前端代理。","ja":"ReactアプリケーションのStitches RSCに構造化されたテーマ設定が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 애플리케이션의 Stitches RSC에 구조화된 테마 구성이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan configuraciones de temas estructuradas para Stitches RSC en aplicaciones de React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de configurations de thème structurées pour Stitches RSC dans les applications React.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die strukturierte Theme-Konfigurationen für Stitches RSC in React-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de configurações de tema estruturadas para Stitches RSC em aplicações React.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы структурированные конфигурации тем для Stitches RSC в приложениях React.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تكوينات موضوع منظمة ل Stitches RSC في تطبيقات React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate properly structured and typed theme configurations for Stitches RSC, utilizing design tokens organized by scale, including colors, spacing, font sizes, and font families, all within a React development environment using TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理生成适当结构化和类型化的主题配置的能力，用于Stitches RSC，利用按比例组织的设计令牌，包括颜色、间距、字体大小和字体家族，所有这些都在使用TypeScript的React开发环境中实现。","ja":"Stitches RSC用の適切に構造化されたタイプ付きのテーマ設定を生成するエージェントの能力を提供します。スケールで組織化されたデザイントークンを利用し、カラー、スペーシング、フォントサイズ、フォントファミリーなど、TypeScriptを使用したReact開発環境で実現します。","ko":"Stitches RSC에 적합한 구조화되고 유형화된 테마 구성을 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. 스케일로 구성된 디자인 토큰을 사용하여 색상, 스페이싱, 글꼴 크기 및 글꼴 패밀리 등을 TypeScript를 사용한 React 개발 환경에서 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar configuraciones de temas adecuadamente estructuradas y tipadas para Stitches RSC, utilizando tokens de diseño organizados por escala, incluyendo colores, espaciado, tamaños de fuente y familias de fuentes, todo dentro de un entorno de desarrollo de React que utiliza TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des configurations de thème correctement structurées et typées pour Stitches RSC, en utilisant des jetons de conception organisés par échelle, incluant des couleurs, des espacements, des tailles de police et des familles de polices, le tout dans un environnement de développement React utilisant TypeScript.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, ordnungsgemäß strukturierte und typisierte Theme-Konfigurationen für Stitches RSC zu generieren, unter Verwendung von Design-Tokens, die nach Skala organisiert sind, einschließlich Farben, Abständen, Schriftgrößen und Schriftfamilien, alles innerhalb einer React-Entwicklungsumgebung, die TypeScript verwendet.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem configurações de tema adequadamente estruturadas e tipadas para Stitches RSC, utilizando tokens de design organizados por escala, incluindo cores, espaçamento, tamanhos de fonte e famílias de fontes, tudo dentro de um ambiente de desenvolvimento React usando TypeScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать правильно структурированные и типизированные конфигурации тем для Stitches RSC, используя токены дизайна, организованные по масштабу, включая цвета, расстояния, размеры шрифтов и семейства шрифтов, все в среде разработки React с использованием TypeScript.","ar":"يمكن للعميل توليد تكوينات موضوع منسقة ومدروسة بشكل جيد ل Stitches RSC، باستخدام رموز التصميم المنظمة حسب النطاق، بما في ذلك الألوان والتباعد وأحجام الخطوط وعائلات الخطوط، كل ذلك داخل بيئة تطوير React باستخدام TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating customizable design tokens for React components","Creating scalable typography configurations for web applications","Automating theme configuration for Stitches RSC projects"],"zh":["为React组件生成可定制的设计令牌","为Web应用程序创建可扩展的排版配置","自动化Stitches RSC项目的主题配置"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネント用のカスタマイズ可能なデザイントークンを生成する","Webアプリケーションのためにスケーラブルな組版設定を作成する","Stitches RSCプロジェクトのテーマ設定を自動化する"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트를 위한 사용자 지정 가능한 디자인 토큰을 생성하는 것","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 확장 가능한 타이포그래피 구성 생성","Stitches RSC 프로젝트의 테마 구성 자동화"],"es":["Generar tokens de diseño personalizables para componentes de React","Crear configuraciones de tipografía escalables para aplicaciones web","Automatizar la configuración de temas para proyectos de Stitches RSC"],"fr":["Générer des jetons de conception personnalisables pour les composants React","Créer des configurations de typographie escalables pour les applications web","Automatiser la configuration du thème pour les projets Stitches RSC"],"de":["Generieren von anpassbaren Design-Tokens für React-Komponenten","Erstellen von skalierbaren Schriftsatz-Konfigurationen für Webanwendungen","Automatisieren der Theme-Konfiguration für Stitches RSC-Projekte"],"pt":["Gerar tokens de design personalizáveis para componentes React","Criar configurações de tipografia escaláveis para aplicações web","Automatizar a configuração do tema para projetos Stitches RSC"],"ru":["Генерировать настраиваемые токены дизайна для компонентов React","Создавать масштабируемые конфигурации типографики для веб-приложений","Автоматизировать конфигурацию темы для проектов Stitches RSC"],"ar":["توليد رموز تصميم قابلة للتعديل لمكونات React","إنشاء تكوينات خطوط قابلة للتحجيم لتطبيقات الويب","تأتمتة تكوين الموضوع لمشاريع Stitches RSC"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Stitches RSC and React setup","Limited to generating theme configurations for Stitches RSC"],"zh":["需要Stitches RSC和React设置","仅限生成Stitches RSC的主题配置"],"ja":["Stitches RSCとReactの設定が必要","Stitches RSCのテーマ設定の生成のみ"],"ko":["Stitches RSC와 React 설정이 필요함","Stitches RSC의 테마 구성 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Stitches RSC y React","Limitado a la generación de configuraciones de temas para Stitches RSC"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Stitches RSC et React","Limité à la génération de configurations de thème pour Stitches RSC"],"de":["Benötigt Stitches RSC- und React-Setup","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Theme-Konfigurationen für Stitches RSC"],"pt":["Requer configuração Stitches RSC e React","Limitado à geração de configurações de tema para Stitches RSC"],"ru":["Требует настройки Stitches RSC и React","Ограничен генерацией конфигураций темы для Stitches RSC"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Stitches RSC و React","محدود بإنشاء تكوينات موضوع ل Stitches RSC"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7ddf5072c22e565797d1f96017f0d65d6bb6eadaa06d