vidor para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Les modèles htmx sont un patron de conception pour Django qui utilise le rendu HTML serveur pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","de":"htmx-Muster sind ein Entwurfsmuster für Django, das serverseitiges HTML-Rendering verwendet, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","pt":"htmx-patterns é uma técnica de renderização de HTML fragmentos no servidor","ru":"htmx-patterns — это техника рендеринга фрагментов HTML на сервере для ИИ Агентов","ar":"htmx-patterns هي تقنية لتحويل شظايا HTML على الخادم لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Server renders HTML fragments, not JSON, for efficient data transfer","Utilizes partial templates (_partial.html) for HTMX responses","Employs progressive enhancement for pages that work without JavaScript","Leverages django-htmx middleware for HTMX detection in views","Uses request.htmx for conditional rendering of templates"],"zh":["服务器端渲染HTML片段","逐步增强页面","最小的客户端复杂性","使用_django-htmx_中间件","支持partial templates"],"ja":["サーバーサイドレンダリングHTMLフラグメント","プログレッシブエンハンスメント","最小のクライアントサイド複雑さ","django-htmxミドルウェアを使用","パーシャルテンプレートをサポート"],"ko":["서버측 렌더링 HTML 조각","진행적 개선","최소한의 클라이언트 측 복잡성","django-htmx 미들웨어 사용","부분 템플릿 지원"],"es":["Renderizado de HTML en el servidor","Plantillas parciales (_partial.html) para respuestas htmx","Mejora progresiva — páginas funcionan sin JS, htmx mejora la experiencia del usuario","Complejidad mínima en el lado del cliente — deja que el servidor realice el trabajo pesado","Detección de htmx en vistas con `django-htmx`"],"fr":["Rendu HTML serveur","Modèles partiels (_partial.html) pour les réponses htmx","Amélioration progressive — les pages fonctionnent sans JS, htmx améliore l''expérience utilisateur","Complexité minimale sur le côté client — laissez le serveur effectuer le travail lourd","Détection de htmx dans les vues avec `django-htmx`"],"de":["Serverseitiges HTML-Rendering","Teil- Vorlagen (_partial.html) für htmx-Antworten","Schrittweise Verbesserung — Seiten funktionieren ohne JS, htmx verbessert die Benutzererfahrung","Minimale Komplexität auf der Client-Seite — lassen Sie den Server die Arbeit übernehmen","Erkennung von htmx in Ansichten mit `django-htmx`"],"pt":["Renderização de HTML fragmentos no servidor","Uso de templates parciais (_partial.html) para respostas htmx","Melhoria progressiva — páginas funcionam sem JS","Complexidade mínima no lado do cliente"],"ru":["Рендеринг фрагментов HTML на сервере","Использование частичных шаблонов (_partial.html) для ответов htmx","Прогрессивное улучшение — страницы работают без JS","Минимальная сложность на стороне клиента"],"ar":["تحويل شظايا HTML على الخادم","استخدام قوالب جزئية (_partial.html) لردود أنماط htmx","تحسين تدريجي — الصفحات تعمل بدون JS","تعقيد أدنى على جانب العميل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use htmx-patterns with Django","what is htmx-patterns","htmx-patterns alternative to AJAX","htmx-patterns vs React","htmx-patterns install guide","htmx-patterns setup for Django developers"],"zh":["HTMX patterns","Django","服务器端渲染","HTML片段","逐步增强","AIエージェント","django-htmx","partial templates"],"ja":["HTMX patterns","Django","サーバーサイドレンダリング","HTMLフラグメント","プログレッシブエンハンスメント","AIエージェント","django-htmx","パーシャルテンプレート"],"ko":["HTMX patterns","Django","서버측 렌더링","HTML 조각","진행적 개선","AI Tools","django-htmx","부분 템플릿"],"es":["htmx-patterns","Django","renderizado de HTML en el servidor","plantillas parciales","mejora progresiva","django-htmx","desarrollo web","patrones de diseño"],"fr":["modèles htmx","Django","rendu HTML serveur","modèles partiels","amélioration progressive","django-htmx","développement web","patrons de conception"],"de":["htmx-Muster","Django","serverseitiges HTML-Rendering","Teil-Vorlagen","schrittweise Verbesserung","django-htmx","Webentwicklung","Entwurfsmuster"],"pt":["htmx-patterns","Django","renderização de HTML","templates parciais","melhoria progressiva","desenvolvimento web","padrões de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["htmx-patterns","Django","рендеринг HTML","частичные шаблоны","прогрессивное улучшение","разработка веб-приложений","шаблоны разработки для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["htmx-patterns","Django","تحويل HTML","قوالب جزئية","تحسين تدريجي","تطوير تطبيقات الويب","أنماط التطوير لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Travis-Gilbert","repo":"apply.thelandbank.org","repoPath":"Travis-Gilbert/apply.thelandbank.org","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:01:38Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"htmx-patterns","description":"HTMX patterns for Django including partial templates, form handling, response headers, and progressive enhancement. Use when building interactive views, handling HTMX requests, or creating dynamic page updates.","bodyPreview":"# HTMX Patterns for Django\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n- Server renders HTML fragments, not JSON\n- Partial templates (`_partial.html`) for HTMX responses\n- Progressive enhancement — pages work without JS, HTMX enhances UX\n- Minimal client-side complexity — let the server do the heavy lifting\n\n## HTMX Detection in Views\n\nWith `django-htmx` middleware installed, use `request.htmx`:\n\n```python\ndef my_view(request):\n    context = {...}\n    if request.htmx:\n        return render(request, \"app/_partial.html\"","body":"# HTMX Patterns for Django\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n- Server renders HTML fragments, not JSON\n- Partial templates (`_partial.html`) for HTMX responses\n- Progressive enhancement — pages work without JS, HTMX enhances UX\n- Minimal client-side complexity — let the server do the heavy lifting\n\n## HTMX Detection in Views\n\nWith `django-htmx` middleware installed, use `request.htmx`:\n\n```python\ndef my_view(request):\n    context = {...}\n    if request.htmx:\n        return render(request, \"app/_partial.html\", context)\n    return render(request, \"app/full_page.html\", context)\n```\n\n## Form Handling Pattern\n\n```python\ndef create_view(request):\n    if request.method == \"POST\":\n        form = MyForm(request.POST)\n        if form.is_valid():\n            obj = form.save()\n            if request.htmx:\n                return render(request, \"app/_item.html\", {\"item\": obj})\n            return redirect(\"app:list\")\n        # Return form WITH errors for HTMX\n        if request.htmx:\n            return render(request, \"app/_form.html\", {\"form\": form})\n    else:\n        form = MyForm()\n    return render(request, \"app/create.html\", {\"form\": form})\n```\n\n## Template Organization\n\n- **Partials**: `_partial.html` (underscore prefix) — HTML fragments only\n- **Full pages**: `page.html` — extends `base.html`, includes partials\n- Each partial = one logical UI component\n\n## CSRF Configuration\n\nAdd to `<body>` tag in base template — all HTMX requests include it automatically:\n```html\n<body hx-headers=''{\"X-CSRFToken\": \"{{ csrf_token }}\"}''>\n```\n\n## Response Headers\n\n| Header | Purpose | Example |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `HX-Trigger` | Trigger client-side events | `response[\"HX-Trigger\"] = \"applicationCreated\"` |\n| `HX-Redirect` | Client-side redirect | `response[\"HX-Redirect\"] = reverse(\"app:detail\", args=[obj.pk])` |\n| `HX-Retarget` | Override target from server | `response[\"HX-Retarget\"] = \"#main\"` |\n| `HX-Refresh` | Force full page refresh | `response[\"HX-Refresh\"] = \"true\"` |\n\n## UX Requirements\n\n- **Always use `hx-indicator`** for loading states\n- **Always use `hx-disabled-elt=\"this\"`** to prevent double submissions\n- **Always return form errors** in partial templates on validation failure\n- **Always provide feedback** via Django messages or response content\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Missing loading indicators — users click multiple times\n- Returning full pages instead of partials for HTMX requests\n- Not handling form errors — only handling the success case\n- N+1 queries — HTMX views need `select_related()` / `prefetch_related()` too\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:13:25.605Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing dynamic HTML fragment rendering and progressive enhancement with Django.","zh":"适合需要动态HTML片段渲染和使用Django进行渐进增强的Web开发代理。","ja":"Djangoを使用した動的なHTMLフラグメントのレンダリングと進歩的な強化が必要なWeb開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"다이나믹 HTML 프래그먼트 렌더링 및 Django를 사용한渐进增强이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan renderizado de fragmentos de HTML dinámicos y mejora progresiva con Django.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant un rendu de fragments HTML dynamiques et une amélioration progressive avec Django.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die dynamisches Rendern von HTML-Fragmenten und progressive Verbesserung mit Django benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de renderização de fragmentos HTML dinâmicos e melhoria progressiva com Django.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходима динамическая отрисовка фрагментов HTML и прогрессивное улучшение с помощью Django.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل وكيل التطوير الويب التي تحتاج إلى تقديم شظايا HTML ديناميكي وتحسين تدريجي مع Django."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate HTMX with Django, enabling server-rendered HTML fragments and progressive enhancement using partial templates and minimal client-side complexity, leveraging `django-htmx` middleware and `request.htmx` detection.","zh":"赋予代理集成HTMX与Django的能力，实现服务器端渲染的HTML片段和使用部分模板以及最小的客户端复杂性进行进步增强，利用`django-htmx`中间件和`request.htmx`检测。","ja":"エージェントがHTMXをDjangoと統合する能力を提供し、部分テンプレートと最小限のクライアント側複雑さを使用してサーバー側でレンダリングされたHTMLフラグメントと進歩的な強化を実現し、`django-htmx`ミドルウェアと`request.htmx`検出を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 HTMX를 Django와 통합할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여 부분 템플릿 및 최소한의 클라이언트 측 복잡성을 사용하여 서버에서 렌더링된 HTML 프래그먼트 및渐进增强을 가능하게 하며, `django-htmx` 미들웨어 및 `request.htmx` 감지를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar HTMX con Django, lo que permite fragmentos de HTML renderizados por el servidor y una mejora progresiva utilizando plantillas parciales y una complejidad mínima del lado del cliente, aprovechando el middleware `django-htmx` y la detección `request.htmx`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer HTMX avec Django, ce qui permet des fragments HTML rendus par le serveur et une amélioration progressive en utilisant des modèles partiels et une complexité minimale du côté client, en exploitant le middleware `django-htmx` et la détection `request.htmx`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, HTMX mit Django zu integrieren, wodurch serverseitig gerenderte HTML-Fragmente und progressive Verbesserung mithilfe von Teilvorlagen und minimaler Client-Seiten-Komplexität ermöglicht werden, indem das `django-htmx`-Middleware und die `request.htmx`-Erkennung genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes integrem HTMX com Django, habilitando fragmentos HTML renderizados pelo servidor e melhoria progressiva usando modelos parciais e complexidade mínima do lado do cliente, aproveitando o middleware `django-htmx` e a detecção `request.htmx`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать HTMX с Django, что позволяет выполнять отрисовку фрагментов HTML на стороне сервера и прогрессивное улучшение с использованием частичных шаблонов и минимальной сложности на стороне клиента, используя middleware `django-htmx` и обнаружение `request.htmx`.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من دمج HTMX مع Django، مما يتيح تقديم شظايا HTML المحددة على الخادم وتحسين تدريجي باستخدام قوالب جزئية وتعقيد جانب العميل الأدنى، مستفيداً من برنامج `django-htmx` الوسيطและการكشف `request.htmx`."},"useCases":{"en":["Rendering dynamic HTML fragments for web applications","Implementing progressive enhancement for improved user experience","Detecting HTMX requests in Django views using `request.htmx`"],"zh":["渲染Web应用程序的动态HTML片段","实现进步增强以提高用户体验","在Django视图中使用`request.htmx`检测HTMX请求"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションの動的なHTMLフラグメントのレンダリング","進歩的な強化を実施してユーザー体験を向上させる","Djangoビューで`request.htmx`を使用してHTMXリクエストを検出する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션에 대한 다이나믹 HTML 프래그먼트 렌더링","渐进增强을 구현하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 것","Django 뷰에서 `request.htmx`를 사용하여 HTMX 요청 감지"],"es":["Renderizado de fragmentos de HTML dinámicos para aplicaciones web","Implementación de una mejora progresiva para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Detección de solicitudes HTMX en vistas de Django utilizando `request.htmx`"],"fr":["Rendu de fragments HTML dynamiques pour les applications Web","Mise en œuvre d''une amélioration progressive pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Détection des requêtes HTMX dans les vues Django à l''aide de `request.htmx`"],"de":["Rendern von dynamischen HTML-Fragmenten für Webanwendungen","Implementierung einer progressiven Verbesserung für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Erkennung von HTMX-Anfragen in Django-Views mithilfe von `request.htmx`"],"pt":["Renderização de fragmentos HTML dinâmicos para aplicações web","Implementação de melhoria progressiva para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Detecção de solicitações HTMX em views Django usando `request.htmx`"],"ru":["Отрисовка динамических фрагментов HTML для веб-приложений","Реализация прогрессивного улучшения для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Обнаружение запросов HTMX в представлениях Django с помощью `request.htmx`"],"ar":["تقديم شظايا HTML ديناميكي لتطبيقات الويب","تنفيذ تحسين تدريجي لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","اكتشاف طلبات HTMX في مشاهد Django باستخدام `request.htmx`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Django framework","Needs `django-htmx` middleware installation","Limited to server-side rendering with HTMX"],"zh":["需要Django框架","需要安装`django-htmx`中间件","仅限于使用HTMX的服务器端渲染"],"ja":["Djangoフレームワークが必要","`django-htmx`ミドルウェアのインストールが必要","HTMXを使用したサーバー側のレンダリングに限定される"],"ko":["Django 프레임워크가 필요함","`django-htmx` 미들웨어 설치 필요","HTMX를 사용한 서버측 렌더링으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere el framework Django","Necesita la instalación del middleware `django-htmx`","Limitado al renderizado del lado del servidor con HTMX"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Django","Nécessite l''installation du middleware `django-htmx`","Limité au rendu du côté serveur avec HTMX"],"de":["Benötigt das Django-Framework","Benötigt die Installation des `django-htmx`-Middleware","Begrenzt auf serverseitiges Rendern mit HTMX"],"pt":["Exige framework Django","Necessita instalação do middleware `django-htmx`","Limitado à renderização do lado do servidor com HTMX"],"ru":["Требует framework Django","Требует установки middleware `django-htmx`","Ограничен отрисовкой на стороне сервера с HTMX"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Django","يحتاج إلى تثبيت برنامج `django-htmx` الوسيط","محدود بالت描سة من جانب الخادم مع HTMX"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7e6e437a0ceeef9c8f43c4b907023f0c64a682115711c1b5eb13bb01eef58750","qualityScore":33}');
