"테넌시 엑서사이저는 멀티 테넌트 커뮤니티 플랫폼의 보안 솔루션으로서, 모든 데이터베이스 쿼리에 커뮤니티 ID 를 포함하는 것을 보장한다","es":"Tenancy-enforcer es un skill que garantiza la seguridad y la privacidad en plataformas de comunidad multi-tenant","fr":"Tenancy-enforcer est un skill qui assure la sécurité et la confidentialité dans les plateformes de communauté multi-locataires","de":"Tenancy-enforcer ist ein Skill, der die Sicherheit und den Datenschutz in Multi-Tenant-Community-Plattformen gewährleistet","pt":"O que é tenancy-enforcer? É uma ferramenta de segurança para plataformas de multi-tenancy que garante a inclusão de communityId em consultas de banco de dados","ru":"Что такое tenancy-enforcer? Это инструмент безопасности для мульти-арендаторных платформ, обеспечивающий включение communityId во все запросы базы данных","ar":"ما هو tenancy-enforcer؟ هو أداة أمان لمنصات الايجارات المتعددة التي تضمن تضمين communityId في استفسارات قاعدة البيانات"},"features":{"en":["Enforces communityId filtering for MongoDB queries (find, update, delete)","Supports repository method creation with communityId inclusion","Implements service layer logic for role-scoped notifications","Adds new indexes to schemas for efficient query execution","Creates aggregate pipelines for complex data processing"],"zh":["MongoDB 查询过滤器中包含 communityId","创建存储库方法和服务层逻辑","添加新索引到 schema","创建聚合管道","从 JWT Token 中提取 communityId"],"ja":["MongoDB クエリフィルターに communityId を含める","リポジトリメソッドとサービス層ロジックを作成する","スキーマに新しいインデックスを追加する","集計パイプラインを作成する","JWT トークンから communityId を抽出する"],"ko":["MongoDB 쿼리 필터에 커뮤니티 ID 포함","리포지토리 메서드와 서비스 계층 로직 생성","스키마에 새로운 인덱스 추가","집계 파이프라인 생성","JWT 토큰에서 커뮤니티 ID 추출"],"es":["Gestión de visibilidad de guardias","Pagos mensuales basados en hogares","Flujos de trabajo de verificación","Notificaciones con ámbito de roles","Integración con MongoDB para consultas y actualizaciones","Implementación de lógica de servicio y creación de índices"],"fr":["Gestion de la visibilité des gardes","Paiements mensuels basés sur les ménages","Flux de travail de vérification","Notifications avec étendue de rôles","Intégration avec MongoDB pour les requêtes et les mises à jour","Mise en œuvre de la logique de service et création d''index"],"de":["Verwaltung der Sichtbarkeit von Wachdiensten","Monatliche Zahlungen basierend auf Haushalten","Verifizierungs-Workflows","Benachrichtigungen mit Rollenbereich","Integration mit MongoDB für Abfragen und Updates","Implementierung von Service-Logik und Erstellung von Indexen"],"pt":["Inclusão de communityId em todas as consultas de banco de dados","Suporte a MongoDB para armazenamento de dados","Integração com JWT Token para autenticação","Verificação de workflows e notificações com escopo de papel","Criação de índices e pipelines de agregação"],"ru":["Включение communityId во все запросы базы данных","Поддержка MongoDB для хранения данных","Интеграция с JWT Token для аутентификации","Проверка рабочих процессов и уведомлений с учетом ролей","Создание индексов и агрегационных конвейеров"],"ar":["تضمين communityId في جميع استفسارات قاعدة البيانات","دعم MongoDB لتخزين البيانات","تكامل مع JWT Token للتأكد","تحقق من سير العمل والتنبيهات بنطاق الدور","إنشاء فهارس وأنابيب التجميع"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tenancy-enforcer","tenancy-enforcer setup guide","MongoDB query security","multi-tenant community platform","tenancy-enforcer alternative","tenancy-enforcer vs competitor","implementing tenancy-enforcer for AI agents","tenancy-enforcer install","secure MongoDB queries"],"zh":["Tenancy Enforcer","多租户社区平台","MongoDB 查询","社区 ID","安全解决方案","AIエージェント","多租户安全"],"ja":["Tenancy Enforcer","マルチテナントコミュニティプラットフォーム","MongoDB クエリ","コミュニティ ID","セキュリティソリューション","AIエージェント","マルチテナントセキュリティ"],"ko":["테넌시 엑서사이저","멀티 테넌트 커뮤니티 플랫폼","MongoDB 쿼리","커뮤니티 ID","보안 솔루션","AI 에이전트","멀티 테넌트 보안"],"es":["tenancy-enforcer","plataformas de comunidad multi-tenant","gestión de visibilidad de guardias","pagos mensuales","flujos de trabajo de verificación","notificaciones con ámbito de roles","integración con MongoDB","Herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","Agentes de IA para comunidades"],"fr":["tenancy-enforcer","plateformes de communauté multi-locataires","gestion de la visibilité des gardes","paiements mensuels","flux de travail de vérification","notifications avec étendue de rôles","intégration avec MongoDB","Outils de l''IA pour les développeurs","Agents de l''IA pour les communautés"],"de":["tenancy-enforcer","Multi-Tenant-Community-Plattformen","Verwaltung der Sichtbarkeit von Wachdiensten","monatliche Zahlungen","Verifizierungs-Workflows","Benachrichtigungen mit Rollenbereich","Integration mit MongoDB","AI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agents für Communitys"],"pt":["tenancy-enforcer","segurança de multi-tenancy","MongoDB","JWT Token","autenticação","verificação de workflows","notificações com escopo de papel"],"ru":["tenancy-enforcer","безопасность мульти-арендаторности","MongoDB","JWT Token","аутентификация","проверка рабочих процессов","уведомления с учетом ролей"],"ar":["tenancy-enforcer","أمان متعدد الإيجارات","MongoDB","JWT Token","التأكد","تحقق من سير العمل","التنبيهات بنطاق الدور"]}},"owner":"muhammadcaeed","repo":"aegis","repoPath":"muhammadcaeed/aegis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T11:55:28Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tenancy-enforcer","description":"Use this skill when writing MongoDB queries, repository methods, or service logic in Aegis. It enforces strict multi-tenancy by ensuring communityId is always included.","bodyPreview":"# Aegis Multi-Tenancy Enforcer\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Writing ANY MongoDB query (find, update, delete)\n- Creating repository methods\n- Implementing service layer logic\n- Adding new indexes to schemas\n- Creating aggregate pipelines\n\n## The Absolute Rule\n\n**Every database query MUST include `communityId` in the filter.**\n\nNo exceptions. Cross-community access is a security breach.\n\n## Source of communityId\n\n### Correct: From JWT Token\n\n```typescript\n// Controller extracts from token\n@Get()","body":"# Aegis Multi-Tenancy Enforcer\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Writing ANY MongoDB query (find, update, delete)\n- Creating repository methods\n- Implementing service layer logic\n- Adding new indexes to schemas\n- Creating aggregate pipelines\n\n## The Absolute Rule\n\n**Every database query MUST include `communityId` in the filter.**\n\nNo exceptions. Cross-community access is a security breach.\n\n## Source of communityId\n\n### Correct: From JWT Token\n\n```typescript\n// Controller extracts from token\n@Get()\nasync findAll(@CurrentUser() user: JwtPayload) {\n  return this.service.findAll(user.communityId);\n}\n\n// Service passes to repository\nasync findAll(communityId: string) {\n  return this.repository.findAll(communityId);\n}\n\n// Repository includes in query\nasync findAll(communityId: string) {\n  return this.model.find({\n    communityId: new Types.ObjectId(communityId),\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Wrong: From Request Body\n\n```typescript\n// NEVER DO THIS\n@Post()\nasync create(@Body() dto: CreateDto) {\n  // dto.communityId could be forged by attacker\n  return this.service.create(dto.communityId, dto);\n}\n```\n\n## Repository Method Patterns\n\n### Find Methods\n\n```typescript\n// Always require communityId as parameter\nasync findById(id: string, communityId: string): Promise<Document | null> {\n  return this.model.findOne({\n    _id: new Types.ObjectId(id),\n    communityId: new Types.ObjectId(communityId), // REQUIRED\n  });\n}\n\nasync findByHousehold(householdId: string, communityId: string): Promise<Document[]> {\n  return this.model.find({\n    householdId: new Types.ObjectId(householdId),\n    communityId: new Types.ObjectId(communityId), // REQUIRED\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Update Methods\n\n```typescript\nasync updateById(\n  id: string,\n  communityId: string,\n  data: UpdateDto,\n): Promise<Document | null> {\n  return this.model.findOneAndUpdate(\n    {\n      _id: new Types.ObjectId(id),\n      communityId: new Types.ObjectId(communityId), // REQUIRED in filter\n    },\n    { $set: data },\n    { new: true },\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Delete Methods\n\n```typescript\nasync deleteById(id: string, communityId: string): Promise<boolean> {\n  const result = await this.model.deleteOne({\n    _id: new Types.ObjectId(id),\n    communityId: new Types.ObjectId(communityId), // REQUIRED\n  });\n  return result.deletedCount > 0;\n}\n```\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns (FORBIDDEN)\n\n### Global Queries\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - No communityId filter\nasync findAll(): Promise<Document[]> {\n  return this.model.find({}); // SECURITY BREACH\n}\n\n// WRONG - ID-only lookup\nasync findById(id: string): Promise<Document | null> {\n  return this.model.findById(id); // Can access ANY community''s data\n}\n```\n\n### Optional communityId\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - communityId should never be optional\nasync findById(id: string, communityId?: string): Promise<Document | null> {\n  const filter: any = { _id: new Types.ObjectId(id) };\n  if (communityId) {\n    filter.communityId = new Types.ObjectId(communityId);\n  }\n  return this.model.findOne(filter); // Dangerous when omitted\n}\n```\n\n### Trusting Request Body\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - Request body can be forged\n@Post()\nasync create(@Body() dto: CreatePaymentDto) {\n  return this.paymentService.create({\n    ...dto,\n    communityId: dto.communityId, // Attacker can set any communityId\n  });\n}\n\n// CORRECT - Use JWT context\n@Post()\nasync create(\n  @Body() dto: CreatePaymentDto,\n  @CurrentUser() user: JwtPayload,\n) {\n  return this.paymentService.create({\n    ...dto,\n    communityId: user.communityId, // From authenticated token\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Index Patterns\n\nAll compound indexes MUST have `communityId` as the first field for query efficiency and logical isolation.\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT - communityId first\n@Schema()\nexport class Payment {\n  // ...\n}\n\nPaymentSchema.index({ communityId: 1, householdId: 1 });\nPaymentSchema.index({ communityId: 1, state: 1 });\nPaymentSchema.index({ communityId: 1, householdId: 1, billingPeriodStart: 1 }, { unique: true });\n\n// WRONG - communityId not first\nPaymentSchema.index({ householdId: 1, communityId: 1 }); // Query won''t use index efficiently\nPaymentSchema.index({ state: 1 }); // Global index, no tenant isolation\n```\n\n## Aggregate Pipeline Rules\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT - $match with communityId as first stage\nasync aggregateByHousehold(communityId: string) {\n  return this.model.aggregate([\n    {\n      $match: {\n        communityId: new Types.ObjectId(communityId), // FIRST stage\n      },\n    },\n    {\n      $group: {\n        _id: ''$householdId'',\n        total: { $sum: ''$amount'' },\n      },\n    },\n  ]);\n}\n\n// WRONG - Missing communityId or not first\nasync aggregateAll() {\n  return this.model.aggregate([\n    { $group: { _id: ''$householdId'', total: { $sum: ''$amount'' } } }, // No tenant filter\n  ]);\n}\n```\n\n## Service Layer Enforcement\n\nServices should always require communityId from controllers, never have default values or lookups.\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT - Explicit communityId parameter\n@Injectable()\nexport class PaymentService {\n  async findByHousehold(householdId: string, communityId: string) {\n    return this.repository.findByHousehold(householdId, communityId);\n  }\n}\n\n// WRONG - Fetching communityId from related entity\n@Injectable()\nexport class PaymentService {\n  async findByHousehold(householdId: string) {\n    const household = await this.householdService.findById(householdId);\n    // What if household doesn''t exist? What if wrong community?\n    return this.repository.findByHousehold(householdId, household.communityId);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Exception: Community Collection\n\nThe `Community` collection itself does not have a `communityId` field - it IS the tenant root. When querying communities:\n\n```typescript\n// Community queries use _id directly (admin operations only)\nasync findCommunityById(id: string): Promise<Community | null> {\n  return this.communityModel.findById(id);\n}\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nBefore committing any repository/service code:\n\n- [ ] Every `find()` call includes `communityId` in filter\n- [ ] Every `findOne()` call includes `communityId` in filter\n- [ ] Every `updateOne()`/`updateMany()` includes `communityId` in filter\n- [ ] Every `deleteOne()`/`deleteMany()` includes `communityId` in filter\n- [ ] All aggregate pipelines have `$match` with `communityId` as first stage\n- [ ] `communityId` comes from JWT/controller, not request body\n- [ ] No methods have optional `communityId` parameter\n- [ ] New indexes have `communityId` as first field in compound indexes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:14:48.867Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Tenancy Agents needing secure MongoDB query management.","zh":"适用于需要安全的MongoDB查询管理的多租户代理。","ja":"マルチテナンシー エージェントが安全なMongoDB クエリ管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"안전한 MongoDB 쿼리 관리가 필요한 멀티 테넌시 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Multi-Tenancy que necesitan una gestión de consultas de MongoDB seguras.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Multi-Tenancy ayant besoin d''une gestion de requêtes MongoDB sécurisée.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Tenancy-Agents, die eine sichere MongoDB-Abfrageverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Multi-Tenancy que necessitam de gerenciamento de consultas do MongoDB seguro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов с несколькими арендаторами, которым требуется безопасное управление запросами MongoDB.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء متعددة الإيجار الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة استعلامات MongoDB آمنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce guard duty visibility and household payments using secure MongoDB queries, ensuring every database query includes `communityId` in the filter, with support for JWT token extraction and repository method creation.","zh":"赋予代理人执行守卫职责可见性和家庭付款的权限，使用安全的MongoDB 查询，确保每个数据库查询都包含 `communityId` 过滤器，并支持JWT 令牌提取和存储库方法创建。","ja":"エージェントに、安全なMongoDB クエリを使用して、ガード デューティの可視性と世帯の支払いを強制する権限を付与し、すべてのデータベース クエリに `communityId` フィルターを含め、JWT トークン抽出とリポジトリ メソッドの作成をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 안전한 MongoDB 쿼리를 사용하여 가드 의무의 가시성과 가구의 결제를 강제할 수 있도록 허용하고, 모든 데이터베이스 쿼리에 `communityId` 필터를 포함하며, JWT 토큰 추출 및 저장소 메서드 생성을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar la visibilidad del deber de vigilancia y los pagos del hogar utilizando consultas de MongoDB seguras, asegurando que cada consulta de base de datos incluya `communityId` en el filtro, con soporte para la extracción de tokens JWT y la creación de métodos de repositorio.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer la visibilité du service de garde et les paiements des ménages en utilisant des requêtes MongoDB sécurisées, en s''assurant que chaque requête de base de données inclut `communityId` dans le filtre, avec un support pour l''extraction de jetons JWT et la création de méthodes de référentiel.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Sichtbarkeit der Wachdienstpflicht und die Haushaltszahlungen unter Verwendung sicherer MongoDB-Abfragen durchzusetzen, indem sichergestellt wird, dass jede Datenbankabfrage `communityId` im Filter enthält, mit Unterstützung für die Extraktion von JWT-Tokens und die Erstellung von Repository-Methoden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor a visibilidade do serviço de guarda e os pagamentos domésticos usando consultas do MongoDB seguras, garantindo que cada consulta de banco de dados inclua `communityId` no filtro, com suporte à extração de token JWT e criação de método de repositório.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать видимость охраны и оплату домохозяйств с помощью безопасных запросов MongoDB, гарантируя, что каждый запрос базы данных включает `communityId` в фильтр, с поддержкой извлечения токена JWT и создания метода репозитория.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض رؤية الخدمة الحارسية والمدفوعات المنزلية باستخدام استعلامات MongoDB آمنة، مما يضمن أن يتضمن كل استعلام قاعدة بيانات `communityId` في المرشح، مع دعم استخراج رمز JWT وإنشاء طريقة المستودع."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing community-based access control for MongoDB queries","Generating secure repository methods with communityId filtering","Implementing service layer logic with cross-community access protection"],"zh":["强制执行MongoDB 查询的社区基于访问控制","生成包含社区 ID 筛选的安全存储库方法","实施具有跨社区访问保护的服务层逻辑"],"ja":["MongoDB クエリのコミュニティベースのアクセス制御を強制する","コミュニティ ID フィルタリングを含む安全なリポジトリ メソッドを生成する","クロス コミュニティ アクセス保護を含むサービス層ロジックを実装する"],"ko":["MongoDB 쿼리 위한 커뮤니티 기반 접근 제어 강제","커뮤니티 ID 필터링을 포함한 안전한 저장소 메서드 생성","크로스 커뮤니티 접근 보호를 포함한 서비스 계층 논리 구현"],"es":["Aplicar control de acceso basado en la comunidad para las consultas de MongoDB","Generar métodos de repositorio seguros con filtrado de `communityId`","Implementar lógica de capa de servicio con protección de acceso entre comunidades"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre un contrôle d''accès basé sur la communauté pour les requêtes MongoDB","Générer des méthodes de référentiel sécurisées avec un filtrage de `communityId`","Implémenter une logique de couche de service avec une protection d''accès intercommunautaire"],"de":["Umsetzen einer communitybasierten Zugriffskontrolle für MongoDB-Abfragen","Erzeugen sicherer Repository-Methoden mit `communityId`-Filterung","Implementieren von Dienstschichtlogik mit Schutz des Zugriffs zwischen den Gemeinschaften"],"pt":["Impor controle de acesso baseado em comunidade para consultas do MongoDB","Gerar métodos de repositório seguros com filtragem de communityId","Implementar lógica de camada de serviço com proteção de acesso entre comunidades"],"ru":["Внедрение контроля доступа на основе сообщества для запросов MongoDB","Генерация безопасных методов репозитория с фильтрацией communityId","Реализация логики сервисного слоя с защитой доступа между сообществами"],"ar":["فرض التحكم في الوصول القائم على المجتمع للاستفسارات عن قاعدة البيانات MongoDB","توليد أساليب مستودع آمنة مع تصفية communityId","تنفيذ منطق طبقة الخدمة مع حماية الوصول بين المجتمعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MongoDB database connection","Must include `communityId` in every database query filter","Cross-community access is strictly prohibited"],"zh":["需要MongoDB 数据库连接","必须在每个数据库查询过滤器中包含 `communityId` ","跨社区访问被严格禁止"],"ja":["MongoDB データベース接続が必要","すべてのデータベース クエリ フィルターに `communityId` を含める必要がある","クロス コミュニティ アクセスは厳格に禁止されている"],"ko":["MongoDB 데이터베이스 연결 필요","모든 데이터베이스 쿼리 필터에 `communityId` 포함 필요","크로스 커뮤니티 접근은 엄격히 금지됨"],"es":["Requiere una conexión de base de datos de MongoDB","Debe incluir `communityId` en cada filtro de consulta de base de datos","El acceso entre comunidades está estrictamente prohibido"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion de base de données MongoDB","Doit inclure `communityId` dans chaque filtre de requête de base de données","L''accès intercommunautaire est strictement interdit"],"de":["Benötigt eine MongoDB-Datenbankverbindung","Muss `communityId` in jedem Datenbankabfragefilter enthalten","Der Zugriff zwischen den Gemeinschaften ist streng verboten"],"pt":["Requer conexão de banco de dados do MongoDB","Deve incluir `communityId` em cada filtro de consulta de banco de dados","O acesso entre comunidades é estritamente proibido"],"ru":["Требуется подключение к базе данных MongoDB","Должно включать `communityId` в каждый фильтр запроса базы данных","Доступ между сообществами строго запрещен"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال بقاعدة بيانات MongoDB","يجب أن يتضمن `communityId` في كل مرشح لاستعلام قاعدة البيانات","الوصول بين المجتمعات ممنوع严格"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"63d102c3ac1fb2667fa44903c2ce7d3e9c7fa3a73cc003513950218fa31a6b92","qualityScore":33}');
