tización de flujo de trabajo","Git","GitHub","Solicitudes de extracción","Revisión de código","GitHub CLI","Desarrollo de software","Herramientas de desarrollo","Integración de herramientas"],"fr":["PR","Automatisation du workflow","Git","GitHub","Demandes d''extraction","Révision de code","GitHub CLI","Développement de logiciels","Outils de développement","Intégration d''outils"],"de":["PR","Automatisierung des Workflows","Git","GitHub","Pull-Requests","Code-Überprüfung","GitHub-CLI","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Tool-Integration"],"pt":["PR GitHub","automação de fluxo de trabalho","criação de PR","revisão de PR","comandos CLI do GitHub","fluxo de trabalho do Git","Integração com Git","automatização de tarefas","gerenciamento de PR"],"ru":["ИИ Агент PR","автоматизация workflow","создание PR","обзор PR","команды CLI GitHub","workflow Git","Интеграция с Git","автоматизация задач","менеджмент PR"],"ar":["وكيل PR","تأتمة تدفق العمل","إنشاء طلب سحب","مراجعة طلب سحب","أوامر CLI من GitHub","تدفق العمل في Git","التكامل مع Git","تأتمة المهام","إدارة طلبات السحب"]}},"owner":"udecode","repo":"dotai","repoPath":"udecode/dotai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.270Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr","description":"Comprehensive GitHub pull request management - create regular/draft PRs with descriptions and commits, review PRs with severity ratings. Triggers on create a PR, make a draft PR, review PR, or any PR workflow task.","bodyPreview":"Expert Git and GitHub workflow automation with three core operations:\n\n## Operations\n\n1. **Create PR** - Regular PRs with comprehensive descriptions\n2. **Draft PR** - WIP PRs without automatic review\n3. **Review PR** - Code analysis with severity ratings\n\n## Common GitHub CLI Commands\n\n```bash\n# PR info\ngh pr view [number]                    # View PR\ngh pr list                             # List PRs\ngh pr diff [number]                    # Get diff\n\n# PR creation\ngh pr create --title \"\" --body","body":"Expert Git and GitHub workflow automation with three core operations:\n\n## Operations\n\n1. **Create PR** - Regular PRs with comprehensive descriptions\n2. **Draft PR** - WIP PRs without automatic review\n3. **Review PR** - Code analysis with severity ratings\n\n## Common GitHub CLI Commands\n\n```bash\n# PR info\ngh pr view [number]                    # View PR\ngh pr list                             # List PRs\ngh pr diff [number]                    # Get diff\n\n# PR creation\ngh pr create --title \"\" --body \"\"      # Regular PR\ngh pr create --draft --title \"\" --body \"\"  # Draft PR\n\n# PR updates\ngh pr edit --body \"\"                   # Update description\ngh pr comment [number] --body \"\"       # Add comment\ngh pr ready [number]                   # Mark draft ready\n\n# Reviews\ngh pr review [number] --approve --body \"\"\ngh pr review [number] --request-changes --body \"\"\ngh pr view [number] --comments         # View comments\n\n# Git commands\ngit branch --show-current              # Current branch\ngit status                             # Check changes\ngit diff [--cached]                    # View changes\ngit log --oneline -n 5                 # Recent commits\n```\n\n## Workflow Selection\n\nDetermine operation from user request:\n\n- **\"Create a PR\"** → Read [references/create.md](references/create.md)\n- **\"Create a draft PR\"** or **\"Draft PR\"** → Read [references/draft.md](references/draft.md)\n- **\"Review PR\"** or **\"Review this PR\"** → Read [references/review.md](references/review.md)\n\nEach reference file contains complete workflow, templates, and best practices for that operation.\n\n## Branch Naming Conventions\n\n- `feature/description` - New features\n- `fix/bug-description` - Bug fixes\n- `refactor/component-name` - Code refactoring\n- `docs/update-readme` - Documentation\n- `test/add-unit-tests` - Test additions\n\n## Commit Message Conventions\n\n- `feat:` - New features\n- `fix:` - Bug fixes\n- `refactor:` - Code refactoring\n- `docs:` - Documentation\n- `test:` - Tests\n- `chore:` - Maintenance\n- `style:` - Formatting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:08.744Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined GitHub workflow automation and Git expertise.","zh":"适合需要简化GitHub工作流自动化和Git专业知识的开发代理。","ja":"GitHubのワークフロー自動化とGitの専門知識が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 워크플로 자동화 및 Git 전문 지식이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una automatización de flujo de trabajo de GitHub optimizada y experiencia en Git.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une automatisation de workflow GitHub simplifiée et d''une expertise Git.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittelstände, die eine optimierte GitHub-Workflow-Automatisierung und Git-Expertise benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de automação de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub simplificada e especialização em Git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима упрощенная автоматизация рабочего процесса GitHub и опыт работы с Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى ت 자동azione مسرعة لتدفق العمل على GitHub وتخصص في Git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate PR creation, drafting, and review processes using GitHub CLI commands, streamlining developer workflows with features like code analysis and severity ratings.","zh":"赋予代理人使用GitHub CLI命令自动化PR创建、草稿和审查流程的能力，通过代码分析和严重性评级等功能简化开发人员的工作流程。","ja":"GitHub CLIコマンドを使用してPRの作成、下書き、レビューのプロセスを自動化する機能をエージェントに与え、コード分析や重大性評価などの機能で開発者のワークフローを最適化します。","ko":"GitHub CLI 명령을 사용하여 PR 생성, 초안 및审查 프로세스를 자동화할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여 코드 분석 및 심각도 평가 등의 기능으로 개발자의 워크플로우를 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la creación de solicitudes de extracción, el borrador y los procesos de revisión utilizando comandos de GitHub CLI, simplificando los flujos de trabajo de los desarrolladores con funciones como análisis de código y calificaciones de gravedad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la création de demandes d''extraction, de brouillon et de processus d''examen en utilisant des commandes GitHub CLI, en simplifiant les flux de travail des développeurs avec des fonctionnalités comme l''analyse de code et les notes de gravité.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Erstellung von Pull-Requests, das Entwerfen und die Überprüfungsprozesse mithilfe von GitHub-CLI-Befehlen zu automatisieren, wodurch die Arbeitsabläufe der Entwickler mit Funktionen wie Codeanalyse und Schweregradbewertungen gestreamlined werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a criação de PR, elaboração e processos de revisão usando comandos da CLI do GitHub, simplificando os fluxos de trabalho dos desenvolvedores com recursos como análise de código e classificações de gravidade.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать создание PR, подготовку и процессы рассмотрения с помощью команд GitHub CLI, упрощая рабочие процессы разработчиков с функциями, такими как анализ кода и рейтинги严重ности.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تفويض الوكلاء لآلية إنشاء PR ومراجعة وتنقيح Operations باستخدام أوامر CLI من GitHub، وتسهيل تدفقات العمل للمطورين بميزات مثل تحليل الشفرة وتقييمات الجدية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating regular PR creation with comprehensive descriptions","Drafting WIP PRs without automatic review","Reviewing code with severity ratings for improved quality control"],"zh":["使用全面描述自动化定期PR创建","草稿WIP PR而不进行自动审查","使用严重性评级审查代码以提高质量控制"],"ja":["包括詳細な説明を持つPRの定期的な作成を自動化する","自動レビューを行わないWIP PRの草稿を作成する","重大性評価を使用してコードをレビューし、品質管理を向上させる"],"ko":["전체 설명을 사용하여 정기적인 PR 생성을 자동화하는 것","자동审查 없이 WIP PR 초안을 작성하는 것","심각도 평가를 사용하여 코드를审查하여 품질 관리를 개선하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación regular de solicitudes de extracción con descripciones exhaustivas","Creación de solicitudes de extracción WIP sin revisión automática","Revisión de código con calificaciones de gravedad para un mejor control de calidad"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création régulière de demandes d''extraction avec des descriptions complètes","Création de demandes d''extraction WIP sans examen automatique","Examen de code avec des notes de gravité pour un meilleur contrôle de qualité"],"de":["Automatisierung der regelmäßigen Erstellung von Pull-Requests mit umfassenden Beschreibungen","Erstellung von WIP-Pull-Requests ohne automatische Überprüfung","Überprüfung von Code mit Schweregradbewertungen für eine verbesserte Qualitätskontrolle"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação regular de PR com descrições abrangentes","Elaborar PRs em andamento sem revisão automática","Revisar código com classificações de gravidade para controle de qualidade aprimorado"],"ru":["Автоматизировать регулярное создание PR с полными описаниями","Подготавливать PR в работе без автоматической проверки","Проверять код с рейтингами严重ности для улучшенного контроля качества"],"ar":["آلية إنشاء PR المنتظم مع الوصف الشامل","إعداد PRs قيد العمل بدون مراجعة آلية","مراجعة الشفرة مع تقييمات الجدية لتحسين سيطرة الجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Limited to GitHub workflows"],"zh":["需要安装GitHub CLI","仅限GitHub工作流"],"ja":["GitHub CLIのインストールが必要","GitHubのワークフローのみに限定される"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치가 필요함","GitHub 워크플로에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de GitHub CLI","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de GitHub CLI","Limité aux flux de travail GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von GitHub CLI","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Arbeitsabläufe"],"pt":["Requer instalação do GitHub CLI","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho do GitHub"],"ru":["Требуется установка GitHub CLI","Ограничен рабочими процессами GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت GitHub CLI","محدود بتدفقات عمل GitHub"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b3e99f829bcd4a08ea6bcf4c8c9156d77acc1017e6e5efeec01ec132410dc007","qualityScore":33}');
