h Vector JS SDK は、ベクトルデータベースを管理するための JavaScript SDK","ko":"Upstash Vector JS SDK는 벡터 데이터베이스를 관리하는 위한 JavaScript SDK","es":"Upstash Vector JS SDK es un conjunto de herramientas para almacenar, consultar y administrar vectores de embeddings","fr":"Upstash Vector JS SDK est un ensemble d''outils pour stocker, interroger et gérer des vectores de embeddings","de":"Upstash Vector JS SDK ist ein Satz von Tools für das Speichern, Abfragen und Verwalten von Vektoren von Einbettungen","pt":"Upstash Vector JS SDK é uma biblioteca JavaScript para armazenar e gerenciar embeddings de vetores","ru":"Upstash Vector JS SDK — это JavaScript-библиотека для хранения и управления векторными вложениями, используя ИИ Агенты","ar":"Upstash Vector JS SDK هي مكتبة جافاسكريبت لتخزين وإدارة تعبئة المتجهات باستخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Installs the Vector TS SDK for TypeScript compatibility","Connects to a Vector instance using a REST URL and token","Upserts vectors and queries them for efficient data management","Manages namespaces for organized vector embedding storage","Utilizes the @upstash/vector package for seamless integration"],"zh":["支持向量嵌入的存储和查询","提供高性能的向量数据库管理","支持 TypeScript","提供简单的 API 接口","支持 Upsert 和查询操作"],"ja":["ベクトル埋め込みのストレージとクエリーをサポート","高性能のベクトルデータベース管理を提供","TypeScript をサポート","シンプルな API インターフェースを提供","Upsert とクエリー操作をサポート"],"ko":["벡터 임베딩의 저장과 조회를 지원","높은 성능의 벡터 데이터베이스 관리를 제공","TypeScript를 지원","간단한 API 인터페이스를 제공","Upsert와 조회 연산을 지원"],"es":["Almacenamiento de vectores de embeddings","Consulta de vectores","Administración de namespaces","Integración con TypeScript","Uso de la API de Upstash Vector","Soporte para vectores de alta velocidad"],"fr":["Stockage de vecteurs de embeddings","Interrogation de vecteurs","Gestion de namespaces","Intégration avec TypeScript","Utilisation de l''API de Upstash Vector","Prise en charge de vecteurs haute performance"],"de":["Speicherung von Vektoren von Einbettungen","Abfrage von Vektoren","Verwaltung von Namespaces","Integration mit TypeScript","Verwendung der Upstash Vector-API","Unterstützung für Vektoren mit hoher Leistung"],"pt":["Armazenamento de embeddings de vetores com alta performance","Consulta de vetores com suporte a upsert","Gerenciamento de namespaces","API simples para integração com aplicações JavaScript","Suporte a TypeScript"],"ru":["Хранение векторных вложений с высокой производительностью","Запрос векторов с поддержкой upsert, используя ИИ Агенты","Управление namespaces","Простой API для интеграции с JavaScript-приложениями","Поддержка TypeScript"],"ar":["تخزين تعبئة المتجهات بأداء عال","استعلام المتجهات مع دعم التعديل","إدارة مساحات الأسماء","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات بسيطة للتحكم مع التطبيقات جافاسكريبت","دعم لغة TypeScript"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use upstash-vector-js","upstash-vector-js setup guide","upstash-vector-js alternative","upstash-vector-js vs vector databases","upstash-vector-js install","what is upstash-vector-js","upstash-vector-js for AI agents","vector embedding management","upstash-vector-js TypeScript SDK"],"zh":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","向量数据库","JavaScript SDK","高性能","向量嵌入","AIエージェント","设置指南"],"ja":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","ベクトルデータベース","JavaScript SDK","高性能","ベクトル埋め込み","AIエージェント","セットアップガイド"],"ko":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","벡터 데이터베이스","JavaScript SDK","높은 성능","벡터 임베딩","AI 에이전트","설정 가이드"],"es":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","vectores de embeddings","alta velocidad","TypeScript","API de Upstash Vector","almacenamiento de vectores","consulta de vectores","administración de namespaces","herramientas de desarrollo","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","vecteurs de embeddings","haute performance","TypeScript","API de Upstash Vector","stockage de vecteurs","interrogation de vecteurs","gestion de namespaces","outils de développement","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","Vektoren von Einbettungen","hohe Leistung","TypeScript","Upstash Vector-API","Speicherung von Vektoren","Abfrage von Vektoren","Verwaltung von Namespaces","Entwicklungstools","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","armazenamento de vetores","consulta de vetores","gerenciamento de namespaces","TypeScript","JavaScript","desenvolvimento de aplicações","bibliotecas JavaScript","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","хранение векторов","запрос векторов","управление namespaces","TypeScript","JavaScript","разработка приложений","JavaScript-библиотеки","оптимизация производительности","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Upstash Vector JS SDK","تخزين المتجهات","استعلام المتجهات","إدارة مساحات الأسماء","TypeScript","جافاسكريبت","تطوير التطبيقات","مكتبات جافاسكريبت","تحسين الأداء","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"vector-js","repoPath":"upstash/vector-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.271Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-vector-js","description":"Provides quick-start guidance and a unified entry point for Vector features, SDK usage, and integrations. Use when users ask how to work with Vector, its TS SDK, features, or supported frameworks.","bodyPreview":"# Vector Documentation Skill\n\n## Quick Start\n\nVector is a high‑performance vector database for storing, querying, and managing vector embeddings.\n\nBasic workflow:\n\n- Install the Vector TS SDK.\n- Connect to a Vector instance.\n- Upsert vectors, query them, and manage namespaces.\n\nExample (TypeScript):\n\n```ts\nimport { Index } from \"@upstash/vector\";\nconst index = new Index({\n  url: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_URL!,\n  token: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_TOKEN!,\n});\n\nawait index.upsert([{ id:","body":"# Vector Documentation Skill\n\n## Quick Start\n\nVector is a high‑performance vector database for storing, querying, and managing vector embeddings.\n\nBasic workflow:\n\n- Install the Vector TS SDK.\n- Connect to a Vector instance.\n- Upsert vectors, query them, and manage namespaces.\n\nExample (TypeScript):\n\n```ts\nimport { Index } from \"@upstash/vector\";\nconst index = new Index({\n  url: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_URL!,\n  token: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_TOKEN!,\n});\n\nawait index.upsert([{ id: \"1\", vector: [0.1, 0.2], metadata: { tag: \"example\" } }]);\n\nconst results = await index.query({\n  vector: [0.1, 0.2],\n  topK: 5,\n});\n```\n\nFor full usage, refer to the linked skill files below.\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\n### TS SDK Reference\n\n- `sdk-methods`: Explains SDK commands: delete, fetch, info, query, range, reset, resumable-query, upsert\n\n### Features\n\n- `features/namespaces`: Explains namespaces and dataset organization.\n- `features/index-structure`: Covers hybrid and sparse index structures.\n- `features/filtering-and-metadata`: Details metadata storage and server-side filtering.\n\nUse these files for deeper guidance on SDK usage, advanced configurations, algorithms, and integrations.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:13.980Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents working with vector data and needing high-performance vector database interactions.","zh":"适用于需要高性能向量数据库交互的 AI 代理，尤其是处理向量数据的场景。","ja":"ベクトルデータを扱う AI エージェントに適しており、高性能なベクトルデータベースの相互作用が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"벡터 데이터와 고성능 벡터 데이터베이스 상호 작용이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que trabajan con datos vectoriales y necesitan interacciones de base de datos vectoriales de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA travaillant avec des données vectorielles et ayant besoin d''interactions de base de données vectorielles hautes performances.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die mit Vektordaten arbeiten und hochleistungsfähige Vektordatenbank-Interaktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que trabalham com dados vetoriais e necessitam de interações de alto desempenho com bancos de dados vetoriais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, работающих с векторными данными и требующих высокопроизводительных взаимодействий с векторными базами данных.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تعمل مع بيانات متجهة وتحتاج إلى تفاعلات قاعدة بيانات متجهة عالية الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently store, query, and manage vector embeddings using Upstash Vector''s REST API and the Vector TS SDK, enabling advanced data analysis and retrieval capabilities with support for upserting vectors, querying, and managing namespaces.","zh":"通过 Upstash Vector 的 REST API 和 Vector TS SDK，使得代理能够高效地存储、查询和管理向量嵌入，从而实现高级数据分析和检索能力，支持向量的 upsert、查询和命名空间管理。","ja":"Upstash Vector の REST API と Vector TS SDK を使用して、エージェントがベクトル埋め込みを効率的にストア、クエリ、および管理できるようにし、高度なデータ分析および検索機能を実現します。ベクトルの upsert、クエリ、およびネームスペースの管理をサポートしています。","ko":"Upstash Vector의 REST API와 Vector TS SDK를 사용하여 에이전트가 벡터 임베딩을 효율적으로 저장, 쿼리 및 관리할 수 있도록 하여 고급 데이터 분석 및 검색 기능을 가능하게 합니다. 벡터의 upsert, 쿼리 및 네임스페이스 관리를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a almacenar, consultar y gestionar eficientemente incrustaciones de vector utilizando la API REST de Upstash Vector y el SDK Vector TS, lo que permite capacidades de análisis y recuperación de datos avanzados con soporte para insertar, consultar y gestionar espacios de nombres.","fr":"Permet aux agents de stocker, d''interroger et de gérer efficacement les incrustations de vecteur en utilisant l''API REST d''Upstash Vector et le SDK Vector TS, permettant des capacités d''analyse et de récupération de données avancées avec prise en charge de l''insertion, de l''interrogation et de la gestion des espaces de noms.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Vektor-Einbettungen effizient zu speichern, abzufragen und zu verwalten, indem sie die REST-API von Upstash Vector und das Vector TS SDK verwenden, wodurch erweiterte Datenanalyse- und Abrufmöglichkeiten mit Unterstützung für Upsert-Vektoren, Abfragen und Namespaces-Verwaltung ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a armazenar, consultar e gerenciar incorporações de vetores de forma eficiente usando a API REST do Upstash Vector e o SDK Vector TS, permitindo capacidades avançadas de análise e recuperação de dados com suporte para upserting de vetores, consulta e gerenciamento de namespaces.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность эффективно хранить, запрашивать и управлять векторными вложениями с помощью REST API Upstash Vector и SDK Vector TS, обеспечивая продвинутые возможности анализа и извлечения данных с поддержкой upserting векторов, запросов и управления namespace.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تخزين الاستعلامات وإدارة التضمينات المتجهة بفعالية باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Upstash Vector المعتمدة على REST و SDK Vector TS ، مما يتيح إمكانيات تحليل البيانات واسترجاعها المتقدمة مع دعم upserting المتجهات والاستعلام وإدارة المساحات الاسمية."},"useCases":{"en":["Upserting vector embeddings for real-time data analysis","Querying vector databases for similarity searches","Managing namespaces for organized vector data storage"],"zh":["实时数据分析的向量嵌入 upsert","相似性搜索的向量数据库查询","有序向量数据存储的命名空间管理"],"ja":["リアルタイムデータ分析のためのベクトル埋め込みのupsert","類似性検索のためのベクトルデータベースのクエリ","整理されたベクトルデータのストレージのためのネームスペースの管理"],"ko":["실시간 데이터 분석을 위한 벡터 임베딩 upsert","유사성 검색을 위한 벡터 데이터베이스 쿼리","조직된 벡터 데이터 저장을 위한 네임스페이스 관리"],"es":["Insertar incrustaciones de vector para análisis de datos en tiempo real","Consultar bases de datos vectoriales para búsquedas de similitud","Gestionar espacios de nombres para el almacenamiento organizado de datos vectoriales"],"fr":["Insérer des incrustations de vecteur pour l''analyse de données en temps réel","Interroger des bases de données vectorielles pour des recherches de similarité","Gérer des espaces de noms pour le stockage organisé de données vectorielles"],"de":["Vektor-Einbettungen für Echtzeit-Datenanalyse einfügen","Vektordatenbanken für Ähnlichkeitssuchen abfragen","Namespaces für organisiertes Vektordaten-Speichern verwalten"],"pt":["Inserção de incorporações de vetores para análise de dados em tempo real","Consulta de bancos de dados vetoriais para pesquisas de similaridade","Gerenciamento de namespaces para armazenamento organizado de dados vetoriais"],"ru":["Upserting векторных вложений для анализа данных в режиме реального времени","Запрос векторных баз данных для поиска похожих данных","Управление namespace для организованного хранения векторных данных"],"ar":["إدخال التضمينات المتجهة لتحليل البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","استعلام قواعد البيانات المتجهة للبحث عن الأشكال المتشابهة","إدارة المساحات الاسمية لتخزين البيانات المتجهة المنظمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Upstash Vector instance URL and REST token","Dependent on Vector TS SDK for interaction"],"zh":["需要 Upstash Vector 实例 URL 和 REST 令牌","依赖于 Vector TS SDK 进行交互"],"ja":["Upstash Vector インスタンス URL と REST トークンが必要","Vector TS SDK への依存"],"ko":["Upstash Vector 인스턴스 URL 및 REST 토큰이 필요","Vector TS SDK에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una URL de instancia de Upstash Vector y un token REST","Depende del SDK Vector TS para la interacción"],"fr":["Nécessite une URL d''instance Upstash Vector et un jeton REST","Dépend du SDK Vector TS pour l''interaction"],"de":["Benötigt eine Upstash Vector-Instanz-URL und ein REST-Token","Hängt vom Vector TS SDK für die Interaktion ab"],"pt":["Requer URL da instância do Upstash Vector e token REST","Dependente do SDK Vector TS para interação"],"ru":["Требуется URL экземпляра Upstash Vector и токен REST","Зависит от SDK Vector TS для взаимодействия"],"ar":["يتطلب عنوان URL للمثيل Upstash Vector ورمز REST","يعتمد على SDK Vector TS للتفاعل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5719b48049749f0bb829edce966ad3efc30054257e658a34ceb6a7c64f18e7d6","qualityScore":33}');
