cript 라이브러리입니다","es":"upstash-search-js es un cliente de búsqueda de IA que utiliza la API REST de Upstash para realizar búsquedas y actualizaciones","fr":"upstash-search-js est un client de recherche d''IA qui utilise l''API REST d''Upstash pour effectuer des recherches et des mises à jour","de":"upstash-search-js ist ein KI-Suchclient, der die Upstash-REST-API nutzt, um Suchanfragen und Aktualisierungen durchzuführen","pt":"Upstash-search-js é um cliente de busca em HTTP/REST para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Upstash-search-js - это ИИ Агент для разработчиков, предназначенный для поиска.","ar":"upstash-search-js هو عميل بحث إلكتروني ل(ai إجينت) المطورين."},"features":{"en":["Installs via npm using `npm install @upstash/search`","Creates a client instance with `new Search({ url, token })`","Supports upsert operations with `index.upsert({ id, content })`","Performs search operations with `index.search({ query })`","Utilizes the Upstash REST API for search functionality","Compatible with TypeScript via the `@upstash/search` SDK"],"zh":["支持 HTTP/REST API","提供简单的 upsert 和搜索功能","使用 TypeScript SDK 实现","支持环境变量配置","提供索引和搜索结果管理功能"],"ja":["HTTP/REST API をサポート","シンプルな upsert と検索機能を提供","TypeScript SDK を使用","環境変数の設定をサポート","インデックスと検索結果の管理機能を提供"],"ko":["HTTP/REST API 지원","단순한 upsert 와 검색 기능 제공","TypeScript SDK 사용","환경 변수 설정 지원","인덱스와 검색 결과 관리 기능 제공"],"es":["Instalación sencilla con npm install @upstash/search","Creación de un cliente de búsqueda con nueva Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN })","Uso de index.upsert() para actualizar documentos","Uso de index.search() para realizar búsquedas","Compatibilidad con la API REST de Upstash","Soporte para TypeScript"],"fr":["Installation simple avec npm install @upstash/search","Création d''un client de recherche avec new Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN })","Utilisation de index.upsert() pour mettre à jour des documents","Utilisation de index.search() pour effectuer des recherches","Compatibilité avec l''API REST d''Upstash","Support pour TypeScript"],"de":["Einfache Installation mit npm install @upstash/search","Erstellung eines Suchclients mit new Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN })","Verwendung von index.upsert() zum Aktualisieren von Dokumenten","Verwendung von index.search() zum Durchführen von Suchanfragen","Kompatibilität mit der Upstash-REST-API","Unterstützung für TypeScript"],"pt":["Instalação via npm com @upstash/search","Criação de cliente com URL e token de autenticação","Uso de índices personalizados com upsert e busca","Suporte a busca simples e avançada","Integração com REST API para operações de busca"],"ru":["Установка через npm с @upstash/search","Создание клиента с URL и токеном аутентификации","Использование индивидуальных индексов с upsert и поиском","Поддержка простого и расширенного поиска","Интеграция с REST API для операций поиска"],"ar":["التثبيت عبر npm مع @upstash/search","إنشاء عميل مع URL ورمز مصادقة","استخدام فهارس مخصصة مع upsert والبحث","دعم البحث البسيط والمتقدم","التكامل مع REST API للعمليات البحث"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use upstash-search-js","upstash-search-js setup guide","upstash-search-js alternative","upstash-search-js vs elastic search","upstash-search-js install","upstash-search-js REST API","upstash-search-js TypeScript support","upstash-search-js search client","upstash-search-js upsert example"],"zh":["Upstash Search JS","AI 搜索","REST API","JavaScript 库","TypeScript SDK","环境变量配置","索引管理","搜索结果管理"],"ja":["Upstash Search JS","AI エージェント","REST API","JavaScript ライブラリ","TypeScript SDK","環境変数の設定","インデックス管理","検索結果管理"],"ko":["Upstash Search JS","AI 도구","REST API","JavaScript 라이브러리","TypeScript SDK","환경 변수 설정","인덱스 관리","검색 결과 관리"],"es":["upstash-search-js","cliente de búsqueda de IA","API REST de Upstash","TypeScript","npm install @upstash/search","búsqueda de IA","integración de IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones con IA"],"fr":["upstash-search-js","client de recherche d''IA","API REST d''Upstash","TypeScript","npm install @upstash/search","recherche d''IA","intégration d''IA","développement d''applications avec IA"],"de":["upstash-search-js","KI-Suchclient","Upstash-REST-API","TypeScript","npm install @upstash/search","KI-Suche","KI-Integration","Anwendungsentwicklung mit KI"],"pt":["upstash-search-js","ai agent","busca personalizada","REST API","TypeScript SDK","desenvolvedores","npm","índices personalizados","autenticação"],"ru":["upstash-search-js","ИИ Агент","индивидуальный поиск","REST API","TypeScript SDK","разработчики","npm","индивидуальные индексы","аутентификация"],"ar":["upstash-search-js","ai إجينت","بحث مخصص","REST API","TypeScript SDK","مطورين","npm","فهارس مخصصة","مصادقة"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"search-js","repoPath":"upstash/search-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.272Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-search-js","description":"Entry point for documentation skills covering Upstash Search quick starts, core concepts, and TypeScript SDK usage. Use when a user asks how to get started, how indexing works, or how to use the TS client.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash Search Documentation\n\n## Quick Start\n\nInstall the TS SDK:\n\n```\nnpm install @upstash/search\n```\n\nCreate a client and perform a simple upsert + search:\n\n```\nimport { Search } from \"@upstash/search\";\n\nconst client = new Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN });\nconst index = client.index(\"my-index\");\n\nawait index.upsert({ id: \"1\", content: { text: \"hello world\" } });\nconst results = await index.search({ query: \"hello\" });\n```\n\nBasi","body":"# Upstash Search Documentation\n\n## Quick Start\n\nInstall the TS SDK:\n\n```\nnpm install @upstash/search\n```\n\nCreate a client and perform a simple upsert + search:\n\n```\nimport { Search } from \"@upstash/search\";\n\nconst client = new Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN });\nconst index = client.index(\"my-index\");\n\nawait index.upsert({ id: \"1\", content: { text: \"hello world\" } });\nconst results = await index.search({ query: \"hello\" });\n```\n\nBasic steps:\n- Create an index\n- Insert or update documents\n- Run searches or filtered queries\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\n### sdk-overview\nProvides detailed documentation for all TypeScript SDK commands. Includes:\n- delete: Deleting documents\n- fetch: Retrieving a document\n- info: Index info\n- range: Range queries\n- reset: Clearing an index\n- search: Search queries\n- upsert: Adding/updating documents\n- getting-started: Setup steps for the SDK\n\n### quick-start\nProvides a fast, end-to-end workflow for creating a Search database, adding documents, and querying them. Covers essential concepts including:\n- Creating a database and storing credentials\n- Adding documents with content and metadata\n- Understanding content vs metadata (searchability and filterability)\n- Performing searches with optional reranking\n- Filtering syntax with SQL-like or structured filters\n- Common pitfalls and best practices\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:25.132Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing efficient search and upsert operations via REST API","zh":"适合需要通过REST API进行高效搜索和upsert操作的AI代理","ja":"REST APIを介して効率的な検索およびupsert操作を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"REST API를 통해 효율적인 검색 및 upsert 연산이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan operaciones de búsqueda y upsert eficientes a través de REST API","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''opérations de recherche et upsert efficaces via REST API","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die effiziente Such- und Upsert-Operationen über REST API benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de operações de pesquisa e upsert eficientes via REST API","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходимы эффективные операции поиска и upsert через REST API","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيلات الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى عمليات بحث و upsert فعالة عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform simple upsert and search operations using the Upstash REST API, enabling seamless interaction with the @upstash/search library and facilitating HTTP/REST based AI search client development, leveraging TS SDK for robust functionality","zh":"赋予代理使用Upstash REST API执行简单的upsert和搜索操作的能力，实现与@upstash/search库的无缝交互，并促进基于HTTP/REST的AI搜索客户端开发，利用TS SDK实现强大的功能","ja":"Upstash REST APIを使用してシンプルなupsertおよび検索操作を実行するエージェントの機能を提供し、@upstash/searchライブラリとのシームレスな相互作用を可能にし、HTTP/RESTベースのAI検索クライアント開発を促進し、TS SDKを使用して強力な機能を実現する","ko":"Upstash REST API를 사용하여 간단한 upsert 및 검색 연산을 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 기능을 제공하여 @upstash/search 라이브러리와의无缝한 상호 작용을 가능하게 하고 HTTP/REST 기반의 AI 검색 클라이언트 개발을 촉진하며 TS SDK를 사용하여 강력한 기능을 구현합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar operaciones de upsert y búsqueda simples utilizando la API REST de Upstash, lo que permite una interacción sin problemas con la biblioteca @upstash/search y facilita el desarrollo de clientes de búsqueda de IA basados en HTTP/REST, aprovechando el SDK de TS para una funcionalidad robusta","fr":"Habilite les agents à effectuer des opérations upsert et de recherche simples en utilisant l''API REST Upstash, permettant une interaction transparente avec la bibliothèque @upstash/search et facilitant le développement de clients de recherche d''IA basés sur HTTP/REST, en exploitant le SDK TS pour une fonctionnalité robuste","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, einfache Upsert- und Suchoperationen mithilfe der Upstash-REST-API durchzuführen, was eine nahtlose Interaktion mit der @upstash/search-Bibliothek ermöglicht und die Entwicklung von HTTP/REST-basierten KI-Suchclients erleichtert, indem es das TS-SDK für eine robuste Funktionalität nutzt","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem operações de upsert e pesquisa simples usando a API REST do Upstash, habilitando interação transparente com a biblioteca @upstash/search e facilitando o desenvolvimento de clientes de pesquisa de IA baseados em HTTP/REST, aproveitando o SDK do TS para funcionalidade robusta","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять простые операции upsert и поиска, используя REST API Upstash, обеспечивая беспрепятственное взаимодействие с библиотекой @upstash/search и облегчая разработку клиентов ИИ-поиска на основе HTTP/REST, используя SDK TS для надёжной функциональности","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من أداء عمليات upsert و بحث بسيطة باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST لشركة Upstash، وتتمكن من التفاعل السلس مع مكتبة @upstash/search وتسهيل تطوير العملاء البحث عن الذكاء الاصطناعي القائم على بروتوكول HTTP/REST، واستخدام SDK TS للوظائف القوية"},"useCases":{"en":["Upserting documents into a search index","Searching for specific queries within an index","Creating and managing search indexes via the Upstash REST API"],"zh":["将文档upsert到搜索索引中","在索引中搜索特定查询","通过Upstash REST API创建和管理搜索索引"],"ja":["検索インデックスにドキュメントをupsertする","インデックス内で特定のクエリを検索する","Upstash REST APIを使用して検索インデックスを作成および管理する"],"ko":["검색 인덱스에 문서를 upsert하는 것","인덱스 내에서 특정 쿼리를 검색하는 것","Upstash REST API를 사용하여 검색 인덱스를 생성 및 관리하는 것"],"es":["Insertar documentos en un índice de búsqueda","Buscar consultas específicas dentro de un índice","Crear y administrar índices de búsqueda a través de la API REST de Upstash"],"fr":["Insérer des documents dans un index de recherche","Rechercher des requêtes spécifiques à l''intérieur d''un index","Créer et gérer des index de recherche via l''API REST Upstash"],"de":["Dokumente in einen Suchindex einfügen","Spezifische Abfragen innerhalb eines Index suchen","Suchindizes über die Upstash-REST-API erstellen und verwalten"],"pt":["Inserção de documentos em um índice de pesquisa","Pesquisa de consultas específicas dentro de um índice","Criação e gerenciamento de índices de pesquisa via API REST do Upstash"],"ru":["Добавление документов в индекс поиска","Поиск конкретных запросов внутри индекса","Создание и управление индексами поиска через REST API Upstash"],"ar":["إضافة مستندات إلى فهرس البحث","البحث عن استفسارات محددة داخل الفهرس","إنشاء وإدارة فهارس البحث من خلال واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST لشركة Upstash"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Upstash Search REST URL and token","Dependent on @upstash/search library"],"zh":["需要Upstash Search REST URL和令牌","依赖@upstash/search库"],"ja":["Upstash Search REST URLとトークンが必要","@upstash/searchライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["Upstash Search REST URL 및 토큰이 필요","@upstash/search 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere URL y token de búsqueda de Upstash","Dependiente de la biblioteca @upstash/search"],"fr":["Nécessite l''URL et le jeton de recherche Upstash","Dépendant de la bibliothèque @upstash/search"],"de":["Benötigt Upstash-Such-URL und -Token","Abhängig von der @upstash/search-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Requer URL e token de pesquisa do Upstash","Dependente da biblioteca @upstash/search"],"ru":["Требуется URL и токен поиска Upstash","Зависит от библиотеки @upstash/search"],"ar":["يتطلب عنوان URL وتوكن البحث لشركة Upstash","يعتمد على مكتبة @upstash/search"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7f68061661f3a02d7dc7d4c3d9f620275d45093ff14e6fe5fb45bfcbce8b2cef","qualityScore":33}');
