INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('imansmallapple/app-StrayPet/arkts-coding-standard', 'arkts-coding-standard', 'imansmallapple', 'app-StrayPet', 'community', 'arkts-coding-standard imansmallapple app-StrayPet community The arkts-coding-standard skill provides guidelines for writing correct ArkTS code, focusing on strict typing and performance optimizations for HarmonyOS development. This skill benefits developers working with ArkTS and HarmonyOS. ArkTS编码标准提供了HarmonyOS开发的严格类型和性能优化指南，帮助开发者避免非法类型和对象字面量类型。 ArkTSコーディングスタンダードは、HarmonyOS開発のための厳格な型とパフォーマンス最適化に関するガイドラインを提供し、開発者が不正な型やオブジェクトリテラル型を回避するのに役立ちます。 ArkTS 코딩 표준은 HarmonyOS 개발을 위한 엄격한 유형 및 성능 최적화를 제공하여 개발자가 불법 유형 및 객체 리터럴 유형을 피할 수 있도록 도와줍니다. El estándar de codificación ArkTS proporciona directrices y validación para escribir código ArkTS correcto, centrándose en tipos estrictos y optimizaciones de rendimiento para el desarrollo de HarmonyOS La norme de codage ArkTS fournit des lignes directrices et une validation pour écrire du code ArkTS correct, en se concentrant sur les types stricts et les optimisations de performances pour le développement HarmonyOS Der ArkTS-Coding-Standard bietet Richtlinien und Validierung für die Erstellung von korrektem ArkTS-Code, mit Fokus auf strenge Typen und Leistungsoptimierungen für die HarmonyOS-Entwicklung O ArkTS Coding Standard fornece diretrizes e validação para escrever código ArkTS correto, com foco em tipagem estrita e otimizações de desempenho ИИ Агент ArkTS Coding Standard предоставляет руководство и проверку для написания правильного кода ArkTS, с уделением внимания строгой типизации и оптимизациям производительности معيار الترميز ArkTS يوفر إرشادات وتصحيح للكتابة الصحيحة لكود ArkTS، مع التركيز على الترميز الصارم وتحسين الأداء how to use arkts-coding-standard what is arkts-coding-standard arkts-coding-standard vs TypeScript arkts-coding-standard install arkts-coding-standard setup guide for HarmonyOS arkts-coding-standard best practices arkts-coding-standard alternative for efficient coding arkts-coding-standard tutorial for beginners arkts-coding-standard documentation arkts-coding-standard examples ArkTS编码标准 HarmonyOS开发 严格类型 性能优化 any类型 unknown类型 对象字面量类型 AIエージェント 代码质量 Enforces strict typing to prevent the use of Any/Unknown Types Validates against illegal practices, such as Object Literal Types Provides guidelines for performance optimizations in HarmonyOS development Supports the development of efficient and correct ArkTS code Helps avoid common pitfalls, such as using forbidden type annotations Promotes best practices for ArkTS coding, including the avoidance of discouraged patterns arkts-coding-standard is a set of guidelines and validation rules for writing efficient and correct ArkTS code, emphasizing strict typing and performance optimizations.');
